slide\"> so it\nsurvives print and PDF export.\n\nThe palette and chrome are generated by ../../brand/apply_brand.py; the fenced\n<style id=\"catalyst-brand\"> block and the catalyst-brand:chrome spans are\nregenerated on every run and must not be hand-edited.\n\nAlso tightens two slides (Growing Pains revisited, Micro-Frontends Cheatsheet)\nwhose row rhythm no longer cleared the new chrome at 16:9, and rebrands the\nspeaker cheat-sheet, which stays on white because it is printed.","tree":{"sha":"4ed84efe067800c178aeb75ac47e5a4f567daa94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eng-AhmedMahmoud/frontend-architecture-slides/git/trees/4ed84efe067800c178aeb75ac47e5a4f567daa94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eng-AhmedMahmoud/frontend-architecture-slides/git/commits/a398df55805a9b54a34d32535fddfb8426d7c6e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78612108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eng-AhmedMahmoud","id":78612108,"login":"eng-AhmedMahmoud","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NjEyMTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eng-AhmedMahmoud","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eng-Ah