9983e847218ef49bca576196b9e93a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:53:30Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:53:30Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"feat!: UI pixel art e pulizia del template\n\nRifà lo stile del remote in pixel art: font Press Start 2P caricato via\n@font-face dal CSS del remote (niente <link> da iniettare nello host, con\nfallback al monospace di sistema), cornici NES-style a angoli smussati,\nbottoni con ombra dura e pressione, badge di stato squadrati, sprite del\npacco disegnato a rettangoli e overlay scanline. Palette chiara e scura\nentrambe rifatte.\n\nToglie i residui del template Vite: componente Button, react.svg, vite.svg\n(sostituito da una favicon pixel), e le regole di App.css/index.css che\ncentravano e coloravano la pagina di sviluppo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24599d55b13ba5c98e1842145da2256bffe8db31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MFE-Orchestrator-Sandbox/orders/git/trees/24599d55b13ba5c98e1842145da2256bffe8db31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MFE-Orchestrator-Sandbox/orders/git/commits/a5763fe8d69983e847218ef49bca576196b9e93a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MFE-Orchestrator-Sandbox/orders/commit/a5763fe8d69983e847218ef49bca576196b9e93a","node_id":"C_kwDOTxPZTdoAKGE1NzYzZmU4ZDY5OTgzZTg0NzIxOGVmNDliY2E1NzYxOTZiOWU5M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MFE-Orchestrator-Sandbox/orders/commit/3e34440c72af4430c6472b5706ac056764a8f82d","sha":"3e34440c72af4430c6472b5706ac056764a8f82d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MFE-Orchestrator-Sandbox/orders/commits/3e34440c72af4430c6472b5706ac056764a8f82d"}],"sha":"a5763fe8d69983e847218ef49bca576196b9e93a","url":"https