ith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:22:34Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"message":"ci(release): refuse unpublishable Angular output before publish\n\nnpm pack --dry-run never runs prepublishOnly, so CI could not see the\npublish-blocking script ngc injects for full-compilation-mode Angular\nlibraries; the first release dry run found it instead. This check runs\nafter build in CI and as the last gate before publish in the release\nworkflow, and tests both the cause (compilationMode not partial in an\n@nx/angular:package project''s prod tsconfig) and the symptom (a\nprepublishOnly script in any shipped @braidlabs dist package.json).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dd792087d8d17b0c6f81718e4632926a50e37a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/git/trees/4dd792087d8d17b0c6f81718e4632926a50e37a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/git/commits/4276bd55d54c5888dd4a2b541ff9f2be482ea681","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5161547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jefftopia","id":5161547,"login":"Jefftopia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/subscriptions","type":"User",