events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jefftopia","id":5161547,"login":"Jefftopia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/6c7c31ac3f34d21eb459d5a417869a9cfe1a5de0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T02:10:58Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T02:10:58Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"message":"fix(release): push the changelog commit and version tag after publishing\n\nnx release resolves each release''s current version from v{version} git tags,\nbut the workflow never pushed what it created — the tag and changelog commit\ndied with the runner, npm had v0.1.0, and the repo still claimed 0.0.1. The\nnext release would have minted 0.1.0 again and collided. Push after publish\nso a failed publish never leaves a tag for a release that did not ship; the\nv0.1.0 tag is backfilled onto the commit it was published from.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9030f551da3bbb7b7b4a5a12fba3497993ed909e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/git/trees/9030f551da3bbb7b7b4a5a12fba3497993ed909e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/git/commits/6c7c31ac3f34d21eb459d5a417869a9cfe1a5de0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5161547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jefftopia","id":5161547,"login":"Jefftopia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/braidjs/braid/commit/6c7c31ac3f34d21eb459d5a417869a9cfe1a5de0","node_id":"C_kwDOTxQ1a9oAKDZjN2MzMWFjM2YzNGQyMWViNDU5ZDVhNDE3ODY5YTljZmUxYTVkZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/braidjs/braid/commit/885ddd424254bfca399b4d22577577827edad295","sha":"885ddd424254bfca399b4d22577577827edad295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/885ddd424254bfca399b4d22577577827edad295"}],"sha":"6c7c31ac3f34d21eb459d5a417869a9cfe1a5de0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/6c7c31ac3f34d21eb459d5a417869a9cfe1a5de0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5161547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jefftopia","id":5161547,"login":"Jefftopia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/885ddd424254bfca399b4d22577577827edad295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T02:10:40Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T02:10:40Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"message":"feat(tutorials): step-by-step tutorials for core, build, angular-core, and angular-data — served through federation\n\nFour illustrated tutorials live in docs/tutorials as the single source:\nrendered on GitHub, and shipped as static assets (tutorial-content/) in both\ndemo builds. The remote exposes a new ./Tutorials module that fetches and\nrenders them with marked; the host routes to it at /tutorials behind the\nsame lazy()-wrapped loadRemote path as ./FundDetail, and the standalone\nremote gets an Editor/Tutorials view switch. Screenshots are captured from\nthe running production demo, including the boundary inspector''s registry\ndowngrade and the studio payload diff.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61f68df2a93d42413abc546842a833ca9145aed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/git/trees/61f68df2a93d42413abc546842a833ca9145aed9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/git/commits/885ddd424254bfca399b4d22577577827edad295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5161547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jefftopia","id":5161547,"login":"Jefftopia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/braidjs/braid/commit/885ddd424254bfca399b4d22577577827edad295","node_id":"C_kwDOTxQ1a9oAKDg4NWRkZDQyNDI1NGJmY2EzOTliNGQyMjU3NzU3NzgyN2VkYWQyOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/braidjs/braid/commit/e58358d98850f9925fc33565a4e87d22c714110a","sha":"e58358d98850f9925fc33565a4e87d22c714110a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/e58358d98850f9925fc33565a4e87d22c714110a"}],"sha":"885ddd424254bfca399b4d22577577827edad295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/885ddd424254bfca399b4d22577577827edad295"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5161547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jefftopia","id":5161547,"login":"Jefftopia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/e58358d98850f9925fc33565a4e87d22c714110a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T21:03:00Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T21:03:00Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"message":"fix(release): publish scoped packages publicly, with provenance metadata\n\nThe 0.1.0 publish failed on every package with \"Can''t generate provenance\nfor new or private package, you must set access to public\".\n\nScoped packages default to access: restricted, and npm refuses to attest\nprovenance for a private one — so enabling NPM_CONFIG_PROVENANCE without\nalso declaring public access could never have worked.\n\n- publishConfig.access = \"public\" on all eight libraries. Declared in the\n  manifest rather than passed as --access on the CI command line, so a\n  local `npm publish` behaves the same way as the workflow.\n- repository (with directory), homepage and bugs. Provenance attests that\n  a tarball was built from a specific source at a specific commit, which\n  requires the manifest to say where that source is; without it the next\n  attempt would have failed on the same step for a different reason. It\n  also gives each package a working Repository link on npm.\n\nVerified the built dist manifests carry both fields, since that is what\nactually gets published.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec7e2f30d66ec6436d3edcba56aadb1679179f99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/git/trees/ec7e2f30d66ec6436d3edcba56aadb1679179f99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/git/commits/e58358d98850f9925fc33565a4e87d22c714110a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5161547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jefftopia","id":5161547,"login":"Jefftopia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/braidjs/braid/commit/e58358d98850f9925fc33565a4e87d22c714110a","node_id":"C_kwDOTxQ1a9oAKGU1ODM1OGQ5ODg1MGY5OTI1ZmMzMzU2NWE0ZTg3ZDIyYzcxNDExMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/braidjs/braid/commit/420f1bd0924dc0be227779fde748b862f54ed1ec","sha":"420f1bd0924dc0be227779fde748b862f54ed1ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/420f1bd0924dc0be227779fde748b862f54ed1ec"}],"sha":"e58358d98850f9925fc33565a4e87d22c714110a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/e58358d98850f9925fc33565a4e87d22c714110a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5161547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jefftopia","id":5161547,"login":"Jefftopia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE1NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jefftopia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/braidjs/braid/commits/420f1bd0924dc0be227779fde748b862f54ed1ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T17:33:37Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T17:33:37Z","email":"jsmith6690@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey Smith"},"message":"fix(release): generate the first changelog from the initial commit\n\n`nx release changelog` computes \"what changed\" by diffing against the\nprevious release tag. On a first release there isn''t one, so it refuses\nrather than guessing a range — which is what failed the 0.1.0 dry run,\nafter versioning had already succeeded.\n\n`automaticFromRef` anchors that diff on the first commit when no tag\nexists. It is not a first-run-only workaround: once 0.1.0 is tagged,\nlater releases diff against that tag as normal, so nothing needs\nremembering or undoing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da4012aaf546d943afc12b46f0d1e012afec7984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/