kypyatochka@gmail.com","name":"Oksnard"},"message":"fix(render): drop top-level environments block (unsupported in Blueprint spec)\n\nRender blueprint schema does not support a top-level ''environments:'' key\n(file.Spec error). Move FRONTEND_URL into the backend service envVars with\na PLACEHOLDER value + sync:false so the Blueprint wizard still prompts for\nit at Apply, and CORS reads it from env.","tree":{"sha":"693946ed5e78dabbe21cccbd92cbbd5505caf744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oksnard/openwolf-assessment/git/trees/693946ed5e78dabbe21cccbd92cbbd5505caf744"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oksnard/openwolf-assessment/git/commits/d7ef88072c53546f289e111e396808a5cb05f2eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36508223?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oksnard","id":36508223,"login":"Oksnard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTA4MjIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oksnard","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Oksnard/openwolf-assessment/commit/d7ef88072c53546f289e111e396808a5cb05f2eb","node_id":"C_kwDOTxVKX9oAKGQ3ZWY4ODA3MmM1MzU0NmYyODllMTExZTM5NjgwOGE1Y2IwNWYyZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Oksnard/openwolf-assessment/com