,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218551972?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X","id":218551972,"login":"LXT-A-X","node_id":"U_kgDODQbWpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/29c02b0a24330c3ea66997e1960865a79415d25c","node_id":"C_kwDOTxbnvNoAKDI5YzAyYjBhMjQzMzBjM2VhNjY5OTdlMTk2MDg2NWE3OTQxNWQyNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/97af7350dffb62f43fda5cc506258af300ccbbc3","sha":"97af7350dffb62f43fda5cc506258af300ccbbc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/97af7350dffb62f43fda5cc506258af300ccbbc3"}],"sha":"29c02b0a24330c3ea66997e1960865a79415d25c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/29c02b0a24330c3ea66997e1960865a79415d25c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/97af7350dffb62f43fda5cc506258af300ccbbc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:52:06Z","email":"777lxtsa@gmail.com","name":"LXT-A-X"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:52:06Z","email":"777lxtsa@gmail.com","name":"LXT-A-X"},"message":"v3.1.2 作者信息规范：author_url 改为个人主页\n\nMoviePilot 详情页读取 __init__.py 的 author_url 类属性显示作者主页链接与头像；原误填仓库地址，现改为 https://github.com/LXT-A-X。plugin_author 保持 GitHub 用户名 LXT-A-X，顺序固定在 plugin_version 之后。package.v3.json 补 author_url 保持同步。","tree":{"sha":"28036f6ba0b6ab98dbdea1a6a898247be4652bde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/28036f6ba0b6ab98dbdea1a6a898247be4652bde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/97af7350dffb62f43fda5cc506258af300ccbbc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/97af7350dffb62f43fda5cc506258af300ccbbc3","node_id":"C_kwDOTxbnvNoAKDk3YWY3MzUwZGZmYjYyZjQzZmRhNWNjNTA2MjU4YWYzMDBjY2JiYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/93444970c561da66a651c3dd1b3eee64b8834fad","sha":"93444970c561da66a651c3dd1b3eee64b8834fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/93444970c561da66a651c3dd1b3eee64b8834fad"}],"sha":"97af7350dffb62f43fda5cc506258af300ccbbc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/97af7350dffb62f43fda5cc506258af300ccbbc3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/93444970c561da66a651c3dd1b3eee64b8834fad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:36:17Z","email":"777lxtsa@gmail.com","name":"LXT-A-X"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:36:17Z","email":"777lxtsa@gmail.com","name":"LXT-A-X"},"message":"v3.1.1 修复华康/日系字体（如 DFPOP1-W5）匹配失败\n\n根因1：_tokenize 只按空格+camelCase 切词，''DFPOP1-W5'' 与字库 ''DFPOP1Std-W5''（含 Std/Win/GB/B5 中缀）分词无交集，名字分退化为 0，DFPOP1Std-W5.otf 落榜。\n\n根因2：ASS 字幕常标 Bold(700) 而华康等字体 usWeightClass=400/500，原字重惩罚 0.25 把名字命中 0.75 的 DFPOP1W5-B5.ttc 打到 0.52，低于 0.6 阈值被拒 -> 静默兜底默认字体。\n\n修复：_tokenize 增强（空格/连字符/下划线 + 字母数字边界 + camelCase）；字重/斜体惩罚降档（0.25->0.15、0.10->0.06、0.15->0.10）。\n\n本地真实字库临时索引验证：DFPOP1-W5->DFPOP1W5-B5.ttc、DFPOP1-W7->DFPOP1Std-W7.otf、DFPOP1Std-W5->DFPOP1Std-W5.otf；方正小标宋/准圆/卡通/DFGHSMincho 无回归。","tree":{"sha":"becf032de93f80e8954ca47a1c103f37346758f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/becf032de93f80e8954ca47a1c103f37346758f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/93444970c561da66a651c3dd1b3eee64b8834fad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/93444970c561da66a651c3dd1b3eee64b8834fad","node_id":"C_kwDOTxbnvNoAKDkzNDQ0OTcwYzU2MWRhNjZhNjUxYzNkZDFiM2VlZTY0Yjg4MzRmYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/13a90577f8fbae7aaf73a09e3f7e3f7bccdb8154","sha":"13a90577f8fbae7aaf73a09e3f7e3f7bccdb8154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/13a90577f8fbae7aaf73a09e3f7e3f7bccdb8154"}],"sha":"93444970c561da66a651c3dd1b3eee64b8834fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/93444970c561da66a651c3dd1b3eee64b8834fad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/13a90577f8fbae7aaf73a09e3f7e3f7bccdb8154/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:22:46Z","email":"777lxtsa@gmail.com","name":"LXT-A-X"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:22:46Z","email":"777lxtsa@gmail.com","name":"LXT-A-X"},"message":"v3.1.0 改进文档 50+ 项全量修复\n\n零：删除 nginx 入口（/subtitle 匿名端点、handle_subtitle、starlette Response 引用），只保留内置反代（8097）单一入口。\n\n严重：跨事件循环治理（缓存/单飞/信号量改 threading 原语）；流式透传独立读超时 read=None；关闭缓存配置真正生效；反代重启 stop 等端口释放 + start 退避重试；两级缓存按字节限容。\n\n中等：passthrough_on_error 生效；依赖兜底补 uharfbuzz/websockets；{注释} 块 } 不入字符集；重建索引期间降级透传；兜底字体如实入缺失统计；内置反代新增 WebSocket 透传；日志去重、缓存统计快照、大流量端点识别；SRT 转 ASS 新增开关 + 硬换行 N。\n\n轻微：gb18030 可打印率校验、字体缓存键含 mtime、watchdog modified 计数、设置页文案、单飞仅 leader 写盘、失败透传复用已回源字节等。\n\n性能：UUEncode base64 平移加速、match LRU + alias_norm 复用、font_id 索引、扫描线程池 + 攒批提交、缓存 key 含 emby_url、_tail_log 累计行数。\n\n前端：Settings 加 SRT 开关、文案修正；Page 解构清理；重新构建 dist。","tree":{"sha":"e341a7a3333dc46c895d078316c451a438fc715b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/e341a7a3333dc46c895d078316c451a438fc715b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/13a90577f8fbae7aaf73a09e3f7e3f7bccdb8154","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/13a90577f8fbae7aaf73a09e3f7e3f7bccdb8154","node_id":"C_kwDOTxbnvNoAKDEzYTkwNTc3ZjhmYmFlN2FhZjczYTA5ZTNmN2UzZjdiY2NkYjgxNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/154e35f263d524894faec6ed406c86ffdf518583","sha":"154e35f263d524894faec6ed406c86ffdf518583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/154e35f263d524894faec6ed406c86ffdf518583"}],"sha":"13a90577f8fbae7aaf73a09e3f7e3f7bccdb8154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LXT-A-X/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/13a90577f8fbae7aaf73a09e3f7e3f7bccdb8154"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218551972?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LXT-A-X","id":218551972,"login":"LXT-A-X","node_id":"U_kgDODQbWpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LXT-A-X/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com