ZiOGY1MWU2Y2Y5YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commit/f56864b8406918908170b7aaa9e09e1596a74ff1","sha":"f56864b8406918908170b7aaa9e09e1596a74ff1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/f56864b8406918908170b7aaa9e09e1596a74ff1"}],"sha":"0cf51dba5aa068dec19d9d4410afb8f51e6cf9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/0cf51dba5aa068dec19d9d4410afb8f51e6cf9af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"ZrisanDev","node_id":"U_kgDOBizQMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/f56864b8406918908170b7aaa9e09e1596a74ff1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T16:17:22Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T16:17:22Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"message":"feat(auth): add refresh-token interceptor with dedup and retry\n\nAdapt the apiClient 401 path to back-hce''s refresh-token architecture\n(#150): a 401 now triggers ONE POST /api/auth/refresh before giving up.\n\n- Add packages/shared/src/auth/refresh.ts: a singleton refresh promise so\n  many concurrent 401s share the same refresh round-trip instead of\n  stampeding the endpoint. tryRefresh calls fetch directly (never req) to\n  avoid an infinite refresh-on-401 loop.\n- Rewire req() in api/client.ts to refresh-first: on a fresh 401 it awaits\n  tryRefresh() and transparently retries the original call once with the\n  rotated cookie. Only when the refresh itself fails does it fire\n  TriggerSessionExpired. The ''retried'' guard caps retries at one.\n- login/logout now pass skipAuthRefresh:true: their 401 means bad\n  credentials / already logged out, not an expired session, so they never\n  refresh or show the modal.\n- Export tryRefresh from @hce/shared/auth and the root barrel.","tree":{"sha":"e2fff0158a7f2d79ab912f2ea9cc0bdd669a999d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/trees/e2fff0158a7f2d79ab912f2ea9cc0bdd669a999d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/commits/f56864b8406918908170b7aaa9e09e1596a74ff1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"ZrisanDev","node_id":"U_kgDOBizQMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/subscriptio