criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commit/52ffb46cfe2bad45831e33dd9656312a9439f9a6","node_id":"C_kwDOTxcYVdoAKDUyZmZiNDZjZmUyYmFkNDU4MzFlMzNkZDk2NTYzMTJhOTQzOWY5YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commit/f49fd4a3ae9e0d67d91cec4b64314c297cf6660c","sha":"f49fd4a3ae9e0d67d91cec4b64314c297cf6660c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/f49fd4a3ae9e0d67d91cec4b64314c297cf6660c"}],"sha":"52ffb46cfe2bad45831e33dd9656312a9439f9a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/52ffb46cfe2bad45831e33dd9656312a9439f9a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"ZrisanDev","node_id":"U_kgDOBizQMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/f49fd4a3ae9e0d67d91cec4b64314c297cf6660c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T05:14:01Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T05:14:01Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"message":"feat(mf-kardex): add filterable kardex list page\n\nClient Component wrapped in <AuthGuard>. Filter bar (plain controlled state,\nno rhf): producto (Select from GET /api/productos, with \"Todos\"), fecha\ninicio/fin (date inputs), tipo de movimiento (Select Entrada/Salida/Todos ->\nidTipoMovimiento 1/2/undefined). \"Aplicar filtros\" -> apiClient.kardex.list;\n\"Limpiar filtros\" resets and refetches.\n\nTable columns: ID Movimiento, Fecha, Tipo (Badge default ENTRADA / secondary\nSALIDA), Origen (COMPRA/VENTA), Producto, Cantidad. States: loading (Skeleton),\nerror (Alert), and explicit empty \"Sin resultados para los filtros aplicados\"\n(REQ-KARDEX-01). Filter values use a \"__all__\" sentinel so base-ui Select\nnever gets an empty-string value (its placeholder sentinel).\n\napiClient.kardex.list serializes filters to the backend snake_case contract\n(id_producto/fecha_inicio/...) since PASO 0 of PR5. NO onInventoryChange here\n(cross-zone auto-refresh is PR6 / Fase 5).\n\ntsc green: apps/mf-kardex.","tree":{"sha":"b014bd424f0b1979cc431c18c71f7049357514a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/trees/b014bd424f0b1979cc431c18c71f7049357514a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/commits/f49fd4a3ae9e0d67d91cec4b64314c297cf6660c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"ZrisanDev","node_id":"U_kgDOBizQMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/orgs","received_events_url"