ommits/b6191a478df01a8e29446fe8a4c2c676244c63ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T05:12:40Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T05:12:40Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"message":"feat(mf-ventas): add registrar page with dynamic items\n\nReplicates the mf-compras registrar pattern (F4-T5): react-hook-form +\nuseFieldArray + zod with a Controller-bridged base-ui Select per row (producto\nfrom GET /api/productos), cantidad + precio number inputs. Payload\nDocDto = { items } via apiClient.ventas.create. Total computed in the UI as an\ninformational hint.\n\nThe front does NOT validate stock (locked decision): on backend rejection\n(e.g. insufficient stock) the ApiError.message is shown in an Alert. NO\nemitInventoryChange (PR6 / Fase 5). On success: sonner toast + redirect to\n/ventas.\n\nMounts <Toaster> in the zone layout so toast() renders. Adds rhf/zod/\n@hookform/resolvers/sonner deps to mf-ventas (bun installs per-workspace; they\nare not resolvable from apps/* despite being on @hce/shared).\n\ntsc green: apps/mf-ventas.","tree":{"sha":"9468afa4f1c974a92b8cc5f4f37f8ab495b534ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/trees/9468afa4f1c974a92b8cc5f4f37f8ab495b534ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/commits/b6191a478df01a8e29446fe8a4c2c676244c63ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"Zri