briel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"message":"fix(shared): correct Compra/Venta list types to cabecera+detalles\n\napiClient.compras.list()/ventas.list() were typed as CompraDet[]/VentaDet[]\n(loose detail rows), but back-hce returns Compra[]/Venta[] (cabecera +\nembedded detalles). PR4 worked around it with an `as unknown as` cast in\nmf-compras; this removes the root cause.\n\n- types: add Compra/Venta (cabecera + detalles); align CompraDet/VentaDet\n  to the backend CompraDetalle/VentaDetalle (drop the redundant cabecera FK\n  that the wire object never carries).\n- apiClient: compras.list() -> req<Compra[]>, ventas.list() -> req<Venta[]>.\n- apiClient: buildQuery now serializes kardex filters to snake_case\n  (id_producto/fecha_inicio/fecha_fin/id_tipo_movimiento) to match the\n  back-hce ListarKardexQuery DTO — camelCase keys were silently dropped by\n  Nest''s whitelist pipe, so filters would have been ignored (fixes the path\n  for the upcoming mf-kardex filter page).\n- mf-compras list: drop the local CompraListItem shape + cast; use Compra\n  from @hce/shared.\n\ntsc green: packages/shared, apps/mf-compras.","tree":{"sha":"c7272e67dcf858a4ab15e5888d82b04dc2e9945a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/trees/c7272e67dcf858a4ab15e5888d82b04dc2e9945a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/commits/9b258f86ea87f1798d9e7d8548b91732c2311101","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"ZrisanDev","node_id":"U_kgDOBizQMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commit/9b258f86ea87f1798d9e7d8548b91732c2311101","node_id":"C_kwDOTxcYVdoAKDliMjU4Zjg2ZWE4N2YxNzk4ZDllN2Q4NTQ4YjkxNzMyYzIzMTExMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commit/5adf37970b5851c495ca36427e3b122a2d0c4169","sha":"5adf37970b5851c495ca36427e3b122a2d0c4169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/5adf37970b5851c495ca36427e3b122a2d0c4169"}],"sha":"9b258f86ea87f1798d9e7d8548b91732c2311101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/9b258f86ea87f1798d9e7d8548b91732c2311101"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"ZrisanDev","node_id":"U_kgDOBizQMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/5adf37970b5851c495ca36427e3b122a2d0c4169/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:55:20Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:55:20Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"message":"feat(mf-compras): add registrar page with dynamic items useFieldArray (F4-T5)\n\nClient Component wrapped in AuthGuard. react-hook-form + useFieldArray +\nzod manage a dynamic list of ItemDto. Each row: idProducto (Select\npopulated from GET /api/productos), cantidad and precio (number inputs)\nwith append/remove and an informational running total. The Select is\nbridged to rhf via Controller (base-ui Select uses onValueChange).\n\nPayload DocDto = { items: ItemDto[] } → apiClient.compras.create. NO\nemitInventoryChange (cross-zone event is PR6 / Fase 5). Success: sonner\ntoast + redirect to ROUTES.compras. Failure: backend ApiError.message in\nan Alert. Remove is disabled while a single row remains to satisfy the\nzod min(1) invariant.","tree":{"sha":"b53dd57841de0f04d5243b734b59f8bcba84ea58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/trees/b53dd57841de0f04d5243b734b59f8bcba84ea58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/commits/5adf37970b5851c495ca36427e3b122a2d0c4169","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"ZrisanDev