https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/189006cd1c10040edf590e4f49a8a19d2486533d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T03:33:46Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T03:33:46Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"message":"feat(shell): add login page and logout route\n\n- app/login/page.tsx: Client Component form (plain <form> + useState; the\n  base-nova kit has no shadcn ''form'' wrapper). Uses input/label/button/card from\n  @hce/shared/ui and calls useAuth().login, surfacing backend ApiError.message.\n  On success hard-redirects (window.location) to ROUTES.home. The HttpOnly\n  cookie is attached by apiClient (credentials:''include''); the form only passes\n  username/password.\n- app/logout/page.tsx: Client Component that calls useAuth().logout (browser\n  POST /api/auth/logout so the HttpOnly cookie travels) then hard-redirects to\n  ROUTES.login. A route handler cannot clear the cookie reliably, hence a page.\n\nVerification: bunx tsc --noEmit -p apps/shell/tsconfig.json -> exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"2fa4734ad509b4474a1043b4cf4f35307aba1d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/trees/2fa4734ad509b4474a1043b4cf4f35307aba1d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/commits/189006cd1c10040edf590e4f49a8a19d2486533d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g