/api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commits/8a652baaa528517fecf8538423a1f3a900f7c744/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T03:32:28Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T03:32:28Z","email":"gabriel.andrade.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"message":"feat(shared/auth): add SessionExpiredProvider with blocking modal\n\nClient Component that subscribes to the session-expired singleton and shows a\nnon-dismissible ''Sesion expirada'' modal on any 401. The Dialog is driven\ncontrolled (open) with no onOpenChange, so backdrop/Escape are no-ops, and\nDialogContent renders showCloseButton={false}; the only exit is the\n''Volver a login'' button, which hard-redirects (window.location) to ROUTES.login\nsince the shell login lives in a different zone. When no expiry is pending it\nrenders children unchanged (wrap-through). Mounted once per zone layout in\nF3-T7. Exported from @hce/shared/auth and the root @hce/shared barrel.\n\nVerification: bunx tsc --noEmit -p packages/shared/tsconfig.json -> exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"4ba92d6ed3310dacda0125c0f5c92c2bf29f2a4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/trees/4ba92d6ed3310dacda0125c0f5c92c2bf29f2a4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/commits/8a652baaa528517fecf8538423a1f3a900f7c744","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users