e.0296@gmail.com","name":"ZrisanDev"},"message":"feat(multi-zones): add rewrites for same-origin /api proxy and zone routing\n\nShell next.config.ts: rewrites put the /api/:path* -> backend proxy FIRST (same-origin, resolves CORS + SameSite for the HttpOnly cookie) then route /productos|/compras|/ventas|/kardex to zones 3001-3004 (overridable via API_ZONA_*), with serverActions.allowedOrigins for localhost:3000. Each zone sets basePath + assetPrefix + transpilePackages:[@hce/shared] and its own /api proxy; the zone /api rewrite uses basePath:false so direct same-origin access is proxied too.","tree":{"sha":"6eba196fcd710cba6989c8f225fca436968fde49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/trees/6eba196fcd710cba6989c8f225fca436968fde49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZrisanDev/front-hce/git/commits/92d4a04afea889febdf52874dca14ccf06134b60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103600178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev","id":103600178,"login":"ZrisanDev","node_id":"U_kgDOBizQMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZrisanDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZrisanDev/front-hce/commit/92d4a04a