":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/c9bdeb170e45f98c8f8da9488a85f49990e1e24b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:18:34Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:18:34Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: show no toast for an assistant whose CLI is not installed\n\nJupyterLab warned on every page load that DeepSeek was enabled but dsh\nwas not on the Jupyter server''s PATH, because the enable key was saved\nin user settings. Enabled means the extension supports an assistant,\nnot that it is installed, so an absent CLI now hides its panel and\nLauncher tile with no toast and one browser-console line.\n\nA jest case and a Galata case cover the saved-key path; both failed on\nthe old code. Comments that described the removed gate are corrected,\nand the review''s MINOR findings are logged in docs/defects.md\n(DEF-PANE-277 to DEF-GUARD-281).","tree":{"sha":"1b4803894d18811fc933678eedaadc49ea7ad7ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/1b4803894d18811fc933678eedaadc49ea7ad7ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyte