sts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/6790d8e37ab5844aef07a9cb67946d527e1586ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:02:55Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:02:55Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: open a background agent''s conversation as an interactive session\n\nOpening a conversation held by a live background agent attached the\nterminal to the agent, so work typed there stayed with the agent and the\nconversation never became the user''s own session. The launch now stops\nthe agent with `claude stop` on a pseudo-terminal, because without a TTY\nthe CLI runs \"stop\" as a new prompt, and then resumes the same id. Attach\nremains only when the stop fails. The Resume labels, the tooltip, the\nledgers and the tests follow the new behaviour.","tree":{"sha":"15c3babddef1f5e81e4202864153f42279dade71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/15c3babddef1f5e81e4202864153f42279dade71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/6790d8e37ab5844aef07a9cb67946d527e1586ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned",