E4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/312dc0e2b62b182308584202939f8e68c5525124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T01:57:29Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T01:57:29Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: restore the favourite-star column and bring panel content 4px from the border\n\nThe star moved beside its label in 1.2.31 and is back in one column at the\nStar Colonel''s request. The time column is now a minimum of 4.5em rather than\na fixed width: in wider system fonts a 7-character label such as \"14m ago\" is\n50px against 48.73px, and a fixed box let it spill past the other labels.\n\nOne --aica-inset of 4px replaces the 8px repeated at five panel edges, which,\nwith the reserved scrollbar gutter, put the time column 23px from the border\nagainst the file browser''s 12px.\n\nMakefile 1.43: every make install raises the version again, and the auth gate\nin make test imports the source tree; publish runs test before install, so the\ngate had been checking the wheel the previous install left in site-packages.","tree":{"sha":"2bc6a2059b8613ada767a14e43d143368544167a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/2bc6a2059b8613ada767a14e43d143368544167a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_