0Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: recognise an npm-installed Claude Code by its command line\n\nThe npm distribution runs cli.js under node, so the comm-only ownership\nrule never claimed its terminal: no reuse after a page reload and no tab\ntint. ClaudeStore.owns_pid matches the native comm first and, for a node\ncomm, claims an argv element whose last path segment is claude or that\nends with the package''s cli.js.\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md and RELEASE.md describe the Makefile lifecycle instead of\nraw pip and jlpm commands, four docstrings and three shipped texts are\ncorrected, and the README names JupyterLab 4.6.0 as the floor. Ledger\nentries DEF-PROV-232 to DEF-GUARD-258 record the five-lens review rounds\nthat produced them.","tree":{"sha":"41027f797ad1581b88fd2a0db43d0f1584ffb10e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/41027f797ad1581b88fd2a0db43d0f1584ffb10e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/22a134f2e6d8f9776c9daf144a765a3468161b2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"sta