ts_extension/commit/51ff1f4f9d249bdafe686dadaa0458192eeecad0","node_id":"C_kwDOTxvH1doAKDUxZmYxZjRmOWQyNDliZGFmZTY4NmRhZGFhMDQ1ODE5MmVlZWNhZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commit/2f1343ddb34f51099b9ba8e4e9333ab7ffe1cb72","sha":"2f1343ddb34f51099b9ba8e4e9333ab7ffe1cb72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/2f1343ddb34f51099b9ba8e4e9333ab7ffe1cb72"}],"sha":"51ff1f4f9d249bdafe686dadaa0458192eeecad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/51ff1f4f9d249bdafe686dadaa0458192eeecad0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/2f1343ddb34f51099b9ba8e4e9333ab7ffe1cb72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T19:52:03Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T19:52:03Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: project-scoped terminals, review rounds 1-3, Manage Sessions row click\n\nDeepSeek''s web UI serves every conversation of a project, so the reuse\nladder keyed by conversation id started a second server on every open.\nterminalScope on the descriptor and TerminalManager._projectTerminal\nanswer every open of a project with its one running terminal, `+` on a\nrunning project settles the pin through launch-argv without spawning,\nand a stopped hand-started server is evicted once the probe confirmed\nit. The simplify pass moved sessionIdPrefix onto the descriptor,\npick_current into core/state.py and the git_branch fill into the route.\n\nThe Manage Sessions popup''s row click always switches; the checkbox is\nthe only select control. DeepSeek''s context menu drops Open Branched\nConversation and its popup Open buttons carry the provider''s verb. The\nREADME states the id-less Codex and Kimi exception to terminal reuse.\n\nGalata''s terminals route mock hid every launched pty behind a default\nshell (DEF-GUARD-230); shared.ts unroutes it, so the suite now runs\nagainst the assistant stubs, plus one spec for the stop-then-relaunch\npath. Makefile from canonical 1.37 to 1.40. Ledger DEF-PANE-203 to\nDEF-SERV-231 closed, none open; journal entries 73 and 74.","tree":{"sha":"51c09606a5a492bae357629cb2f93f5304172853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/51c09606a5a492bae357629cb2f93f5304172853"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/2f1343ddb34f51099b9ba8e4e9333ab7ffe1cb72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/