"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/c8ecd1d521a2ccbb1e09f192db3744c62c74181a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:25:34Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:25:34Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: add the DeepSeek provider, close the round-seven defect batch\n\nDeepSeek joins Claude Code, Codex, Kimi and Gemini: providers/deepseek.py and\nsrc/providers/deepseek.ts, a galata spec, and src/core/labels.ts extracted\nfor the shared label vocabulary; the descriptor-parity, registry and\nprovider-store tests cover it. The defects closed on 2026-09-17 are ruled\nwontfix where the convention belongs to the colourful-tab companion, and the\nREADME states that make install pulls the published companions over a local\nbuild. Version field 1.2.19; no publish.","tree":{"sha":"ce8be6368068498fca672fa3d0516f1a345bb513","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/ce8be6368068498fca672fa3d0516f1a345bb513"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/c8ecd1d521a2ccbb1e09f192db3744c62c74181a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commit/c8ecd1d521a2ccbb1e09f192db3744c62c74181a","node_id":"C_kwDOTxvH1doAKGM4ZWNkMWQ1MjFhMmNjYmIxZTA5ZjE5MmRiMzc0NGM2MmM3NDE4MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commit/9717e0a761f402f02c0709c48724387c9e336755","sha":"9717e0a761f402f02c0709c48724387c9e336755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/9717e0a761f402f02c0709c48724387c9e336755"}],"sha":"c8ecd1d521a2ccbb1e09f192db3744c62c74181a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/c8ecd1d521a2ccbb1e09f192db3744c62c74181a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/9717e0a761f402f02c0709c48724387c9e336755/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T10:21:36Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T10:21:36Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: restore the dark-theme status dot and give light a mint halo\n\nThe dot marking a live or remote-controlled conversation lost its dark\nrendering in 1.2.7 and drew a doubled near-black contour. The stylesheet now\nbranches on the theme attribute JupyterLab stamps on the body, so dark is\nrestored byte-identical and light takes its own rule. That light halo was a\nfive-pass white ring, which reads as a blob on the mid-grey rows the installed\nlight themes draw; it is now three passes of md-green-200 at 2px, chosen from\ncandidates rendered on the live row (DEF-PANE-185, DEF-PANE-201).\n\nSwitching to a conversation now decides what `claude -c` resumes. The switch\nstamps its target far enough ahead that no append overtakes it and releases\nthat stamp when the panel moves off the conversation, and a pinned row no\nlonger adopts a re-homed transcript''s foreign directory (DEF-PANE-176,\nDEF-PANE-197).\n\nPanel text goes through JupyterLab''s translation system, which is what the\n44 outstanding lint warnings were asking for.","tree":{"sha":"7b37082e0830d88306515064c748b2d6c773697e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/7b37082e0830d88306515064c748b2d6c773697e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/9717e0a761f402f02c0709c48724387c9e336755","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commit/9717e0a761f402f02c0709c48724387c9e336755","node_id":"C_kwDOTxvH1doAKDk3MTdlMGE3NjFmNDAyZjAyYzA3MDljNDg3MjQzODdjOWUzMzY3NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commit/3c9c4a8392e094e2443999511929ef22b1b61707","sha":"3c9c4a8392e094e2443999511929ef22b1b61707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/3c9c4a8392e094e2443999511929ef22b1b61707"}],"sha":"9717e0a761f402f02c0709c48724387c9e336755","url":"http