\nadversarial review transcripts. They stay on disk and in history; a\nfresh clone no longer carries them.","tree":{"sha":"750f3cfb04b07f1d17fb9cf07c3e56c9b9b4e4e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/750f3cfb04b07f1d17fb9cf07c3e56c9b9b4e4e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/fa0e87283d90ff5b0aea22e9adb7088d0f93d3e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commit/fa0e87283d90ff5b0aea22e9adb7088d0f93d3e5","node_id":"C_kwDOTxvH1doAKGZhMGU4NzI4M2Q5MGZmNWIwYWVhMjJlOWFkYjcwODhkMGY5M2QzZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commit/abb1d981a0b506d5133245dec8fc02e4f6eda083","sha":"abb1d981a0b506d5133245dec8fc02e4f6eda083","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/abb1d981a0b506d5133245dec8fc02e4f6eda083"}],"sha":"fa0e87283d90ff5b0aea22e9adb7088d0f93d3e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/fa0e87283d90ff5b0aea22e9adb7088d0f93d3e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/abb1d981a0b506d5133245dec8fc02e4f6eda083/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T07:38:29Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T07:38:29Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: own terminal tab colours instead of scraping them (DEF-COLO-155)\n\nA terminal tab kept a colour belonging to a conversation that had ended,\nand the assistant''s own /color could not change it. terminado hands a\nclosed terminal''s name to the next terminal created, the companion\npersisted colours under that name, and reconcileColours read the entry\nback as a colour the user had chosen - the top rung of the ladder, which\noutranks everything the assistant picks. The prune could never see it,\nbecause a recycled name is present in the running list.\n\nThree changes, each removing one link. Capture is now the companion''s\ncolourChanged signal rather than a read of its browser storage, so only\na click can produce a choice. claim(widget) declares that this extension\npersists an assistant tab, so the companion stores nothing for it and the\ntwo no longer hold competing records of one tab. A stored terminal colour\ncarries the pty incarnation behind its name, so a recycled name loses its\ncolour before it can paint.\n\nTerminal tinting now requires the companion release carrying both\nmembers; against an older one the extension tints nothing and says so in\na notification, because a colour it cannot capture would be repainted\nover the user''s pick on the next pass.\n\nREADME corrected on two counts the redesign made false: the tab menu''s\nown Clear does release a stored colour now, and tinting depends on the\ncompanion version.","tree":{"sha":"9a23c2f4739f55ba66f8734bdf50e19912f2afab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/9a23c2f4739f55ba66f8734bdf50e19912f2afab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/abb1d981a0b506d5133245dec8fc02e4f6eda083","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/