ived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/981c79a28f7ffe882614c44e7acc8c49398cca6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T17:46:41Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T17:46:41Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: add Launcher tiles per docked assistant (implementation wave, click-through pending)\n\nEvery assistant whose panel is docked now gets a tile in an \"AI Assistants\"\nLauncher section; a click opens the assistant in the file browser''s current\nfolder, resuming the folder''s conversation when one exists.\n\n- design note docs/design-launcher.md and criteria ACC-LNCH-143..159, 162,\n  ACC-TEST-160..161 in the acceptance ledger\n- POST providers/<id>/launch-argv returns the bare argv; validation and pin\n  bookkeeping shared with the launch handler\n- AssistantSessionsPanel.launchHere(cwd) carries the click path; index.ts\n  registers the tile command and ILauncher item in start(), disposes in stop()\n- pins @jupyterlab/launcher ^4.6.0 and jupyterlab-basic-terminal-extension\n- Jest 146, pytest 191; Galata click-through tests still failing, under\n  diagnosis\n- checkpoint tag CHECKPOINT_BEFORE_LAUNCHER_TILES_1.0.41 marks the released\n  state; minor version moved to 1.1.x","tree":{"sha":"e892556c4e20ca2b17d2cd095d15f9c739d5fc91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/e892556c4e20ca2b17d2cd095d15f9c739d5fc91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyte