githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/851e42108bcd188d9ec5cfdcf0ff09c9cbc0e2a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T16:32:31Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T16:32:31Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: close out every open defect - eight fixes, six rejections\n\nClose-out campaign over the fourteen defects that were logged, not\nfixed: one read-only analyst per defect sized the blast radius with\ngraphify, an adjudicator ordered the eight fixes so no edit shifted a\nlater one''s lines, and each fix landed serially with a mutation-checked\ntest. Confirming review pair clean.\n\n- a sign-in or proxy page returned with status 200 no longer empties\n  the sidebar - `requestAPI` throws on a non-JSON 200, which the\n  DEF-132 contract treats as an unanswered probe (DEF-GUARD-118)\n- `pid_alive` reads a zero or negative pid as dead: those are\n  signalling idioms, and a record carrying one skipped the transcript\n  repair and mis-marked the conversation agent-owned (DEF-SERV-129)\n- gemini fork keeps the chat file byte-faithful: no split on U+2028,\n  no re-escaping of non-ASCII, and a record that cannot be encoded\n  declines the fork instead of raising a 500 (DEF-PROV-131)\n- pre-roster panels say \"Waiting for the server root\" instead of\n  blaming a folder outside the root (DEF-GUARD-134), redraw once when\n  the root arrives (DEF-GUARD-136), and name the missing binary on a\n  503 cli_not_found instead of \"Could not reach the server\"\n  (DEF-GUARD-138)\n- the once-per-page \"binary was not found\" latch clears when a roster\n  reports the assistant available (DEF-GUARD-125, warning half)\n- new src/__tests__/index.spec.ts covers the plugin''s activation path;\n  jest.config.js ignores the two venvs whose duplicate labextension\n  copies broke haste resolution (DEF-GUARD-139)\n\nRejected with reasons in the ledger: DEF-GUARD-120, 122, 123, 137\n(residue of the roster contract - any remedy writes on failure or is\ntiming code), DEF-PROV-128 (the real writer holds no transcript fd\nbetween bursts), DEF-PROV-130 (no symlink producer exists). Ledger\nlegend gains the rejected state; DEF-PANE-140 logged.","tree":{"sha":"7c3791c2a1195a9db4ac6872b3ef09fdade322b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/7c3791c2a1195a9db4ac6872b3ef09fdade322b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/851e42108bcd188d9ec5cfdcf0ff09c9cbc0e2a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","follo