t.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/a47ecfe4dffcf2727c91f8ec568f5b8358142ffd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:16:38Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:16:38Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"docs: record DEF-116 as a proxy blip and a no-op file-browser jump\n\nNeither reported symptom was the extension.\n\nThe 404 burst never reached the Jupyter server - the log holds no 404s\nfor either failing extension all day, the failing requests'' query stamps\nare absent from it, and the failure window has no log lines at all while\nthe server answered the same endpoints in milliseconds either side. Two\nunrelated extensions failed together, JupyterLab''s own notification poll\nreconnected in that window, and the 404 body was plain-text rather than\njupyter_server''s HTML page - the reverse proxy owns it.\n\nShow in File Browser was proven working live against the running lab: the\nbreadcrumb moved to the project folder and listed it. It read as dead\nbecause the file browser had been sitting in that exact folder since the\nsession restore, so the jump changed nothing on screen.\n\nNo feedback on an already-there jump is logged as MINOR, not fixed.","tree":{"sha":"502834273425eeed54c56aa08f7d3d47a3358d0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/502834273425eeed54c56aa08f7d3d47a3358d0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/a47ecfe4dffcf2727c91f8ec568f5b8358142ffd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commit/a47ecfe4dffcf2727c91f8ec568f5b8358142ffd","node_id":"C_kwDOTxvH1doAKGE0N2VjZmU0ZGZmY2YyNzI3YzkxZjhlYzU2OGY1YjgzNTg