n- Galata test clicks the button unarmed first, so the menu-opens branch is\n  proven live and the assertion can fail, then arms the mode through the\n  settings registry, waits for the tooltip to acknowledge it, and asserts\n  no menu reaches the DOM and a terminal appears\n- Defect ledger records the investigation, the non-reproduction evidence\n  and the user''s confirmation\n- Acceptance criterion logs the rendered proof\n\nGalata 29/29.","tree":{"sha":"f5472576a9c86f2403f38e4b876195c94ac276f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/f5472576a9c86f2403f38e4b876195c94ac276f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/6928f0b7226bdf1e23fdab2267a799688c72efd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extensi