58:06Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: vendor-less new-session menu labels and static header tooltip\n\nDEF-114: the + menu entries read \"New session\" and \"New session\n(<mode label>)\" - the provider name gone from both - and the button\ntooltip is the static \"New session in current folder\", no longer\ninterpolating a folder path that deep trees make unreadable. The\narmed-mode tooltip suffix stays per the user''s explicit answer (DEF-36\nstands); armed still means no menu, launch on click. Unit title tests\nand the claude-regression selectors (button title, both menu entry\ntexts, the exact-match launch click) follow. Jest 118, Galata 28/28 at\nv1.0.26, menu rendered and screenshotted. Ledger DEF-114, acc-crit\nwording, journal entries 33-34, changelog 1.0.27.","tree":{"sha":"11c9f04db90dad9cf7efc37c4566b547d527b1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/11c9f04db90dad9cf7efc37c4566b547d527b1c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/1c6fa10dbafe3002b573b387302b6cfefe453fba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stel