"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/0592e751a810663d2bdc6d97f4bf654078f72435/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T05:59:46Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T05:59:46Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: neutral shield colour and sweep-trash cleanup glyph\n\nTwo user rulings on the v1.0.19 icons. The shield on the permission-\nskipping entries paints in the theme''s standard jp-icon3 grey - the\nshape alone marks the entry, reversing DEF-40''s orange half while\nkeeping its 16x16 size half. Clean Up Parallel Sessions stops sharing\nthe unsafe-launch marker and wears the new cleanupIcon (Material\ndelete_sweep) - same family as Remove''s plain trash, visibly the bulk\none. Unit colour test asserts jp-icon3 parity; the Galata probe finds\nthe shield by path data since colour no longer distinguishes it.\nJest 121, Galata 27/27 at v1.0.20, rendered proof screenshotted.\nLedger notes under DEF-40 and DEF-45, journal entries 27-28,\nchangelog 1.0.21.","tree":{"sha":"36cca9c0cc965ccb15567adc49ba3dde6b54fb90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/36cca9c0cc965ccb15567adc49ba3dde6b54fb90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/0592e751a810663d2bdc6d97f4bf654078f72435","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","follow