m/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/21e03aa15ab5fd52e159223b69ef29c2d044216b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:08:44Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:08:44Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: shield glyph on unsafe launch and destructive menu entries\n\nThe danger marker changed from the caution triangle to the shield - the\nestablished glyph for an action touching the permission system (the UAC\npattern) and the one the reference implementation carried. warningIcon\nbecame shieldIcon with the reference''s path; DEF-40''s conspicuousness fix\nis kept deliberately (16x16, jp-icon-warn0 orange), so the reference''s\n13x13 grey is not copied. All seven panel call sites follow, including\nthe DEF-45 marker on Clean Up Parallel Sessions - one danger glyph for\nthe menu. Jest 121, Galata 27/27 at v1.0.18, rendered proof screenshotted.\nLedger note under DEF-40, journal entries 25-26, changelog 1.0.19.","tree":{"sha":"0dbf2355bdf4adac0a08556509f0107821df3036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/0dbf2355bdf4adac0a08556509f0107821df3036"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/21e03aa15ab5fd52e159223b69ef29c2d044216b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stel