}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/commits/ad1402a75d59b8a4fed6b5184e09222c2261b016/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:43:09Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:43:09Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: land the round-7 adversarial wave - wire errors, IOLoop discipline, sdist hygiene\n\nRound 7 ran architect and bug-hunter over the committed v1.0.8 tree and\nboth returned SHIP; the confirmed findings all sat in surfaces the six\nprior rounds never examined.\n\n- render server refusals by their error code instead of the literal\n  [object Object]: requestAPI now falls through message -> error -> body,\n  matching the {\"error\": \"<code>\"} shape all 14 refusal sites send\n- move the launch pre-flight''s project_session_ids off the IOLoop into\n  the same executor as the call beside it (191ms whole-server freeze\n  measured per row click)\n- guard the colour poll with an in-flight check so a hung server no\n  longer grows an unbounded queue the next fork must await\n- answer cleanup of an already-clean project with \"Nothing left to\n  clean up.\" instead of a failure banner\n- exclude .claude/, logs/ and docs/defects.md from sdists (32 internal\n  files shipped in 1.0.0); scratch build proves 0 leaked\n- bind the display label into the cross-runtime descriptor parity test,\n  mutation-checked\n- CHANGELOG resumed at 1.0.10 after stopping at 0.6.17; ledger at 98\n  entries, 79 closed / 19 open","tree":{"sha":"d52d3b6018fe92893a3e38b7bf4b7867fe293c02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/trees/d52d3b6018fe92893a3e38b7bf4b7867fe293c02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_ai_code_assistants_extension/git/commits/ad1402a75d59b8a4fed6b5184e09222c2261b016","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupy