GabouLC","id":147784263,"login":"GabouLC","node_id":"U_kgDOCM8CRw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/commits/e9ccd9794fa0c5cf37587e0b9b7d0f7d4c4eb7f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:03:30Z","email":"gabrielomchos88@gmail.com","name":"Gabriel León"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:03:30Z","email":"gabrielomchos88@gmail.com","name":"Gabriel León"},"message":"docs(sprint-2): documentar el incidente de OOM en producción y la reversión\n\nTras el revert del PR #74 (n8n 2.37.10 en Render), se agrega:\n- Nota permanente en render.yaml explicando qué pasó y qué falta\n  antes de reintentar (más RAM o medir consumo real bajo carga).\n- Cierre del documento de investigación S2-05 con el desenlace real:\n  el deploy en producción causó un loop de reinicios por\n  \"Ran out of memory (used over 512MB)\" (confirmado en Events de\n  Render), no relacionado con el esquema de base de datos. La\n  validación local (PRs #71/#72) sigue siendo válida — es un límite\n  de infraestructura (RAM del plan Free), no un defecto de la\n  implementación.","tree":{"sha":"e8558fb869040aa11da148e6290c9c8032be2398","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/git/trees/e8558fb869040aa11da148e6290c9c8032be2398"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/git/commits/e9ccd9794fa0c5cf37587e0b9b7d0f7d4c4eb7f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":