e\n  credenciales expuestas (no solo los JSON de n8n como hasta ahora).\n- backup-postgres.yml: pg_dump semanal de la base de Render, subido\n  como artefacto — mitiga la falta de backups nativos en el plan\n  Free. Queda en no-op hasta que se agregue el secret\n  RENDER_DATABASE_URL.\n\nREADME de workflows actualizado: documenta los 3 nuevos, y corrige\nque CodeQL ya es required check (quedó desactualizado tras\nagregarlo a Branch Protection).","tree":{"sha":"5e9dbe625933567de18822019c8705284bb53776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/git/trees/5e9dbe625933567de18822019c8705284bb53776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/git/commits/37453fea676fed81d9b556ed5c0cf813be79e162","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147784263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GabouLC","id":147784263,"login":"GabouLC","node_id":"U_kgDOCM8CRw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/commit/37453fea676fed81d9b556ed5c0cf813be79e162","node_id":"C_kwDOTxyiy9oAKDM3NDUzZmVhNjc2ZmVkODFkOWI1NTZlZDVjM