n\n  los nodos viejos de HuggingFace Embeddings (el fix a Gemini del\n  PR #60 nunca se había aplicado manualmente ahí) — ahora igualado\n  al contenido real de main.\n- Prueba end-to-end real: WF2 responde correctamente y Phoenix\n  registra las trazas reales sin errores (36 spans, 0 errores).\n\nIssue #67 (S2-05) resuelto en el entorno local compartido del\nequipo. Pendiente solo la decisión y ejecución en producción.","tree":{"sha":"a4586319d525a64432003ce945c94c8240282197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/git/trees/a4586319d525a64432003ce945c94c8240282197"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/git/commits/4041157a2812674a78e1ab8ded182d017df7828d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147784263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GabouLC","id":147784263,"login":"GabouLC","node_id":"U_kgDOCM8CRw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/commit/4041157a2812674a78e1ab8ded182d017df7828d","node_id":"C_kwDOTxyiy9oAKDQwNDExNTdhMjgxMjY3NGE3OGUxYWI4ZGVkMTgyZDAxN2RmNzgyOGQ","pare