url":"https://github.com/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/commit/da5676a41a1556fc8caff0e2e4d113483105f700","node_id":"C_kwDOTxyiy9oAKGRhNTY3NmE0MWExNTU2ZmM4Y2FmZjBlMmU0ZDExMzQ4MzEwNWY3MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/commit/d68bd41c00cdf48ad9efd06fefe28662807bbdad","sha":"d68bd41c00cdf48ad9efd06fefe28662807bbdad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/commits/d68bd41c00cdf48ad9efd06fefe28662807bbdad"}],"sha":"da5676a41a1556fc8caff0e2e4d113483105f700","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/commits/da5676a41a1556fc8caff0e2e4d113483105f700"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147784263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GabouLC","id":147784263,"login":"GabouLC","node_id":"U_kgDOCM8CRw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabouLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/commits/03851ada596f9a3956043ecff7670d5a47f4be10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:45:08Z","email":"gabrielomchos88@gmail.com","name":"Gabriel León"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:45:08Z","email":"gabrielomchos88@gmail.com","name":"Gabriel León"},"message":"fix(n8n): compatibilizar typeVersion de WF0 y WF1 con n8n 1.83.2\n\nAmbos workflows se exportaron desde una versión de n8n más reciente,\ncon typeVersion no reconocidas por la instancia desplegada en Render\n(1.83.2) — al importarlos, los nodos aparecían sin ícono (\"not\ninstalled\"). Se bajó cada tipo de nodo a la versión ya confirmada\ncomo compatible (verificado contra el WF2, que corre en producción\nsin problemas):\n\n- httpRequest: 4.5 -> 4.2\n- postgres: 2.7 -> 2.4\n- scheduleTrigger: 1.3 -> 1.1\n- extractFromFile: 1.1 -> 1\n- vectorStorePGVector (solo WF0): 1.3 -> 1\n- if (solo WF0): 2.3 -> 2\n\nVerificado en n8n real tras el fix: ambos workflows importan con\ntodos los nodos reconocidos. WF0 corrió exitoso de punta a punta\n(Test workflow, 2:15m, 22 PDFs procesados e insertados en RAG).\n\nWF1 sigue con una falla de red confirmada y no relacionada con este\nfix: el nodo \"HTTP Request 1 MIDAGRI\" recibe ETIMEDOUT al conectar\ndesde Render hacia siea.midagri.gob.pe. Se descartó que sea un\nproblema de URL (la URL es correcta, verificada con curl externo:\n200 OK, contenido real) o de proxy cloud (se probó un proxy en\nCloudflare Workers, que también recibió timeout — error 522). El\npatrón (Render y Cloudflare fallan, una red residencial normal\nconecta sin problema) indica que el firewall de MIDAGRI bloquea\nrangos de IP de hosting/datacenter en general, no un proveedor\nespecífico. Queda documentado como limitación de infraestructura\npendiente de una solución con IP residencial (proxy residencial de\npago, o un script corriendo en una red doméstica que empuje los\ndatos al webhook de n8n).","tree":{"sha":"162c6b53c0991be8591c90ebe084bdc8391bc7dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/git/trees/162c6b53c0991be8591c90ebe084bdc8391bc7dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/equipo2-AgroSmart-Insights/Agrosmart-Insights/git/commits/03851ada596f9a3956043ecff7670d5a47f4be10","verification":{"payl