tivity 신설. RN, 웹뷰 판과 같은 구성(섹션 4, 행 6, 버튼 2)\n- MainActivity 에 --es auto native 분기 추가, 첫 페인트 계측도 같은 정의로 통일\n- 같은 APK 에서 재측정: 화면 하나에 네이티브 +2.1MB, RN +18.9MB, 웹뷰 +118.7MB\n- 11번 README 를 4자 표로 갱신하고 Lynx 델타의 기준점 차이(셸에 엔진 상주) 주의 보강\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aeb2e18ab06148715654be7ed48181fc779be046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/aeb2e18ab06148715654be7ed48181fc779be046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/6d1d6274b714f24c94dcca60733e056c1148e898","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/6d1d6274b714f24c94dcca60733e056c1148e898","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDZkMWQ2Mjc0YjcxNGYyNGM5NGRjY2E2MDczM2UwNTZjMTE0OGU4OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/c094ab1487d2e244ac9d871b6147cf70