"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/c094ab1487d2e244ac9d871b6147cf706bda4a0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/4eab4acedb741e6984e8a377b47000cc88e1b96c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:57:38Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:57:38Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"📝 docs(10-lynx): 엔진 층과 RN 뉴 아키텍처 비교를 검증해서 추가\n\n- PrimJS 를 저장소 기준으로 정리: QuickJS 개조, ES2019, GC 채택, Octane 28% 우위\n- 렌더링은 네이티브 뷰 매핑임을 문서 인용으로 확정 (view→ViewGroup/UIView 등),\n  Flutter 의 자체 캔버스 방식과 갈리는 지점 명시\n- RN 뉴 아키텍처와의 공통점(브리지 제거, 바이트코드)과 차이(스레드 분리의 기본값) 정리\n- 떠도는 오류 세 가지를 근거와 함께 반박:\n  Rust 엔진(실제 C++), 가상 DOM 건너뜀(실제 Preact 포크 의존), UI 60fps 보장(과장)\n- RN 을 worklet 과 JSI 로 튜닝하면 어디까지 같아지는지와 남는 차이 정리\n- 이중 스레드의 실제 프레임 효과는 미측정으로 한계에 명시\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"s