commits/4eab4acedb741e6984e8a377b47000cc88e1b96c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/73c6a13a44ad5b65e9746355cd7250b8b2f83862/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:54:12Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:54:12Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(10-lynx): Lynx 를 에뮬레이터에서 돌리고 RN 과 실측 비교\n\n- create-rspeedy 로 앱 생성, LynxExplorer 4.0.1 에서 렌더와 상태 동작 확인\n- 08 의 RN 카운터와 같은 화면으로 맞춰 번들 비교:\n  Lynx 90,588 bytes vs RN Metro 905,528 / Rspack 836,382 bytes\n- 빌드 시간 2.2~2.5초, HMR 재빌드 0.3~1.1초\n- 번들에 AppRegistry, StyleSheet, __fbBatchedBridge 가 0건인 것으로\n  프레임워크 JS 가 네이티브(Lynx 엔진 + PrimJS)로 옮겨간 구조 확인\n- 코드 차이 기록: 소문자 내장 태그, bindtap, CSS 파일,\n  그리고 <text> 에 문자열과 숫자를 섞으면 숫자가 안 나오는 것\n- ''background only'' 지시어로 드러나는 이중 스레드 구조 정리\n- 09, 10, RN 의 층 차이를 표로 정리하고 도입 판단 기준 작성\n\n부수 수정: 09 의 Stackflow 설정을 당근 공식 데모 방식(route 를 config 에,\n플러그인에는 config 전달)으로 교체\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3590fb02b7dcb2fadc90d10600384a5e666642d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/f3590fb02b7dcb2fadc90d10600384a5e666642d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/73c6a13a44ad5b65e9746355cd7250b8b2f83862","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/73c6a13a44ad5b65e9746355cd7250b8b2f83862","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDczYzZhMTNhNDRhZDViNjVlOTc0NjM1NWNkNzI1MGI4YjJmODM4NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/bedff732ecdcf0d36ece137db51dc2afb516a4cf","sha":"bedff732ecdcf0d36ece137db51dc2afb516a4cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/bedff732ecdcf0d36ece137db51dc2afb516a4cf"}],"sha":"73c6a13a44ad5b65e9746355cd7250b8b2f83862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/73c6a13a44ad5b65e9746355cd7250b8b2f83862"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/bedff732ecdcf0d36ece137db51dc2afb516a4cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T08:00:43Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T08:00:43Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(09-stackflow): 웹뷰 네비게이션 3종을 같은 화면으로 비교하고 검증\n\n- 화면 내용이 동일한 세 벌(plain MPA, plain SPA, Stackflow)을 공용 컴포넌트로 구성\n- 전용 웹뷰 호스트 앱 추가: WebViewClient 와 백 버튼 전달 토글(forwardBack)\n- 실측: 화면 이동 시 MPA 는 문서+번들 147KB 재다운로드, SPA 와 Stackflow 는 0건\n- 스크롤 유지는 Stackflow 만 됨. SPA 는 unmount 되어 0px 로 복귀\n- 백 버튼은 라이브러리가 못 푼다는 것을 토글로 증명. 전달 안 하면 깊이 3에서도 화면 닫힘,\n  전달하면 Stackflow 만 pop 되고 SPA 는 히스토리가 없어 그대로 닫힘\n- Stackflow 는 RN 대체재가 아니라 DOM 위 네비게이션 층이라는 점을 peer 의존성으로 확인\n- 번들 값 111KB 와 스와이프백 제스처 충돌을 한계로 기록\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac4d96872d6ad9c3ae37750f779573c1150e34ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/ac4d96872d6ad9c3ae37750f779573c1150e34ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/bedff732ecdcf0d36ece137db51dc2afb516a4cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/bedff732ecdcf0d36ece137db51dc2afb516a4cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGJlZGZmNzMyZWNkY2YwZDM2ZWNlMTM3ZGI1MWRjMmFmYjUxNmE0Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/41c1ab927761093fa998a940b28881e84b8eb119","sha":"41c1ab927761093fa998a940b28881e84b8eb119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/41c1ab927761093fa998a940b28881e84b8eb119"}],"sha":"bedff732e