api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/d84f8bdb09005d8fdc1abc0d1ec5b19cdaee75a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T11:43:22Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T11:43:22Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(05-repack-federation): iOS 판 추가하고 시뮬레이터에서 원격 로드 검증\n\n- RCTRootView 소비 앱(MfHost)과 Podfile, xcodeproj 생성 스크립트 추가\n- scriptManager 와 remotes 주소를 플랫폼 인식으로 (10.0.2.2/localhost, 경로 세그먼트)\n- 서버를 /android /ios 플랫폼별 산출물 서빙으로 확장\n- initialProps 의 autoOpen 으로 시뮬레이터 GUI 자동화 없이 두 피처 자동 로드\n- iPhone 15 시뮬레이터에서 4건만 다운로드, 장바구니 67ms, 프로필 48ms 마운트 확인\n- Android 회귀 확인 (210ms, /android 경로 2건)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd44fe6a53580b2d6c560f48ee3439a0713981fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/dd44fe6a53580b2d6c560f48ee3439a0713981fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/d84f8bdb09005d8fdc1abc0d1ec5b19cdaee75a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/d84f8bdb09005d8fdc1abc0d1ec5b19cdaee75a9","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGQ4NGY4YmRiMDkwMDVkOGZkYzFhYmMwZDFlYzViMTljZGFlZTc1YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/85e0521cb1424a524cbd5c3b083e63effb1e4ee0","sha":"85e0521cb1424a524cbd5c3b083e63effb1e4ee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/85e0521cb1424a524cbd5c3b083e63effb1e4ee0"}],"sha":"d84f8bdb09005d8fdc1abc0d1ec5b19cdaee75a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/d84f8bdb09005d8fdc1abc0d1ec5b19cdaee75a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/85e0521cb1424a524cbd5c3b083e63effb1e4ee0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T11:26:04Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T11:26:04Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(05-repack-federation): 두 번째 원격 피처를 추가해 멀티 피처 검증\n\n- feature-profile 추가: 한 호스트가 원격 두 개(장바구니, 프로필)를 동시 로드\n- 두 번째 피처는 공유 스코프가 데워져 있어 71ms 에 마운트 (첫 피처 192ms)\n- 원격 코드의 useState 정상 동작으로 React 단일 인스턴스 증명\n- 피처만 재빌드하고 앱 재시작으로 변경 반영, APK 재설치 없음 확인\n- 서버를 원격 이름 → 피처 디렉토리 매핑으로 확장, 호스트는 FEATURES 목록으로 일반화\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96a9bdbb821fa3478ad81741fe07d4db619a9c77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/96a9bdbb821fa3478ad81741fe07d4db619a9c77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/85e0521cb1424a524cbd5c3b083e63effb1e4ee0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/follow