evchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/e88ae11cf7333f6bd3421c66cd34bc6eb05639f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T11:13:37Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T11:13:37Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(05-repack-federation): 번들을 host 와 feature 로 나눠 원격 로드 검증\n\n- Re.Pack 5 + Module Federation 2 로 호스트(내장 934KB)와 피처(원격 152KB + 3KB) 분리\n- 요청 로그 남기는 번들 서버로 런타임에 실제 내려간 목록 검증, react-native 재다운로드 없음 확인\n- 탭 → 마운트 87~136ms, 두 번째 탭 4ms 에 요청 0건 (Pixel 9 에뮬레이터, dev=false)\n- 서버 다운 시 크래시 대신 에러 UI: errorLoadRemote 폴백 플러그인 + 실패 마커\n- 복구 후 재시도는 컨테이너 프로토콜(loadScript, init, get) 직접 수행으로 캐시 우회\n- 겪은 함정 13개를 README 에 정리 (eager 기본값, 산출물 위치, 리졸버 우선순위 등)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a7c321d22104842a3d905377bd4ba160c150cf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/0a7c321d22104842a3d905377bd4ba160c150cf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/e88ae11cf7333f6bd3421c66cd34bc6eb05639f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/e88ae11cf7333f6bd3421c66cd34bc6eb05639f8","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGU4OGFlMTFjZjczMzNmNmJkMzQyMWM2NmNkMzRiYzZlYjA1NjM5Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/e511fb992040e7be6b0879d8186e2adc335e4573","sha":"e511fb992040e7be6b0879d8186e2adc335e4573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/e511fb992040e7be6b0879d8186e2adc335e4573"}],"sha":"e88ae11cf7333f6bd3421c66cd34bc6eb05639f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/e88ae11cf7333f6bd3421c66cd34bc6eb05639f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/e511fb992040e7be6b0879d8186e2adc335e4573/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T09:46:06Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T09:46:06Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(04-new-architecture): 구아키텍처와 신아키텍처를 같은 앱에서 비교\n\n아키텍처는 빌드 플래그라 런타임에 못 바꿉니다. 같은 소스를 두 번 빌드해서\n번갈아 설치하며 쟀습니다. 화면도 측정 코드도 기기도 같고 newArchEnabled 만 다릅니다.\n\n  중앙값 (release, arm64, n=10)   구아키텍처   신아키텍처\n  서피스 1개, 예열 없음             447ms       444ms\n  서피스 1개, 예열 있음             268ms       245ms\n  서피스 2개 중 첫 번째             459ms       388ms\n  두 번째 서피스 추가               66ms        59ms\n  APK 크기                         17.39MB     17.41MB\n\nRN 0.76 에서는 진입 시간도 앱 크기도 거의 안 바뀝니다. 편차가 커서 9~15% 차이는\n노이즈와 구분하기 어렵습니다. 눈에 띄는 건 신아키텍처 쪽 최대값이\n1213ms 에서 704ms 로 줄어든 것인데 원인은 확인 못 했습니다.\n\n달라지는 건 코드입니다. SurfaceActivity.kt 에 두 경로를 나란히 뒀습니다.\n\n  구: ReactInstanceManager + ReactRootView + startReactApplication\n  신: ReactHost + ReactSurface + surface.start() / stop()\n\nstart 와 stop 의 대칭이 생긴 게 핵심입니다. 다만 자동은 아니고\nonDestroy 와 짝지어 부르는 건 여전히 개발자 몫입니다.\n\n빌드에서 나온 것\n\n- ReactSurface 의 패키지가 com.facebook.react.interfaces.fabric 입니다\n- ABI 축소 방법이 01 번과 반대입니다. 신아키텍처는 codegen C++ 를 직접 빌드해서\n  abiFilters 만으로는 안 되고 reactNativeArchitectures 도 줘야 합니다.\n  안 주면 4개 ABI 가 다 들어가 50.4MB 가 됩니다\n- 앱 크기가 안 바뀌는 이유는 0.76 의 libreactnative.so 에 Paper 와 Fabric 이\n  둘 다 들어 있기 때문입니다. 0.84 부터 레거시가 빠지면 결과가 달라집니다\n- 네이티브 모듈은 안 고쳐도 됩니다. 인터롭 레이어가 기존 ReactMethod 를 받아 줍니다\n\n버전별 차이도 정리했습니다. 갈림길은 0.82 로, 거기서 구아키텍처 선택 자체가\n사라집니다. iOS 는 0.76 에 RCTReactNativeFactory 가 없어서(0.77+) 다루지 않았습니다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7e0949ee7ee4b4101923228b81f4db304fcc624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/f7e0949ee7ee4b4101923228b81f4db304fcc624"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/e511fb992040e7be6b0879d8186e2adc335e4573","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/e511fb992040e7be6b0879d8186e2adc335e4573","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGU1MTFmYjk5MjA0MGU3YmU2YjA4NzlkODE4NmUyYWRjMzM1ZTQ1NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/444a762c9d07fe0e00d313caedb0d30c4d4a8391","sha":"444a762c9d07fe0e00d313caedb0d30c4d4a8391","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/444a762c9d07fe0e00d313caedb0d30c4d4a8391"}],"sha":"e511fb992040e7be6b0879d8186e2adc335e4573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/e511fb992040e7be6b0879d8186e2adc335e4573"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/444a762c9d07fe0e00d313caedb0d30c4d4a8391/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T09:06:29Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T09:06:29Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(03-webview-vs-rn): iOS 판 추가하고 같은 측정 수행\n\nAndroid 와 같은 화면, 같은 측정 정의로 iOS 를 만들었습니다.\n\n  탭 → 첫 페인트 (중앙값, n=10)   Android release   iOS release\n  웹뷰 프리워밍 없음                356ms             358ms\n  웹뷰 프리워밍 있음                176ms             295ms\n  RN preload 없음                  246ms             175ms\n  RN preload 있음                  143ms             114ms\n\niOS 도 릴리스 Android 와 방향이 같습니다. RN 이 두 조건 모두 빨랐습니다.\n\n시뮬레이터 숫자는 신뢰도가 낮다는 점을 문서 앞머리와 마지막 절에 명시했습니다.\n호스트 맥 CPU 로 돌고 WebKit 이 macOS 구현을 일부 공유합니다.\n방향만 참고하고 절대값은 인용하지 말라고 적었습니다.\n\n플랫폼 차이도 하나 나왔습니다. 같은 프리워밍인데 효과가 다릅니다.\nAndroid 웹뷰는 51% 줄었는데 iOS 는 18% 입니다. WKProcessPool 을 공유했는데도\n그렇습니다. 원인은 확인 못 해서 그대로 적었습니다.\n\n- 측정 자동화 경로가 플랫폼마다 다릅니다. Android 는 Intent 와 logcat,\n  iOS 는 launch arguments 와 simctl launch --console-pty stdout 입니다.\n  02 번에서 시뮬레이터 창 GUI 자동화가 실패한 뒤 찾은 방법입니다\n- Podfile 에서 use_native_modules! 가 경로가 아니라 명령 배열을 받는다는 점.\n  JS 루트가 ../rn 이라 CLI 를 그쪽에서 돌게 명령을 만들어 넘겼습니다\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d7eab1e616feaf2f8d5333858469dff6d0c28cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/6d7eab1e616feaf2f8d5333858469dff6d0c28cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/444a762c9d07fe0e00d313caedb0d30c4d4a8391","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/444a762c9d07fe0e00d313caedb0d30c4d4a8391","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDQ0NGE3NjJjOWQwN2ZlMGUwMGQzMTNjYWVkYjBkMzBjNGQ0YTgzOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/699a63ea5999c0105a116260114ea9922f0938c7","sha":"699a63ea5999c0105a116260114ea9922f0938c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/699a63ea5999c0105a116260114ea9922f0938c7"}],"sha":"444a762c9d07fe0e00d313caedb0d30c4d4a8391","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/444a762c9d07fe0e00d313caedb0d30c4d4a8391"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/699a63ea5999c0105a116260114ea9922f0938c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T08:42:01Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T08:42:01Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(03-webview-vs-rn): 같은 화면을 웹뷰와 RN 으로 만들어 나란히 측정\n\n같은 앱 안에 같은 구성의 화면(섹션 4, 행 6, 버튼 2)을 두 방식으로 만들고\n같은 정의로 쟀습니다. 시작은 네이티브가 화면 전환을 시작한 시각,\n끝은 콘텐츠가 화면에 나간 직후 JS 가 알려 온 시각입니다.\n웹뷰는 rAF 두 번, RN 은 InteractionManager 뒤 rAF 두 번에서 신호를 보냅니다.\n\n핵심 발견은 빌드 타입으로 결론이 뒤집힌다는 점입니다.\n\n  탭 → 첫 페인트 (중앙값, n=10)   debug    release\n  웹뷰 프리워밍 없음                544ms    356ms\n  웹뷰 프리워밍 있음                225ms    176ms\n  RN preload 없음                  767ms    246ms\n  RN preload 있음                  484ms    143ms\n\ndebug 에서는 웹뷰가 두 조건 다 이기고 release 에서는 RN 이 두 조건 다 이깁니다.\nGradle 이 react-android 의 debug 변종(심볼 미제거 20.5MB)을 가져오고\n-Xcheck:jni 가 켜져서 RN 만 크게 손해를 봅니다.\n웹뷰는 Chromium 이 OS 에 있어 빌드 타입 영향을 거의 안 받습니다.\n\n- 앱 용량: 웹뷰 0 (APK 에 webkit 항목 0개), RN 은 so 11.4MB + dex 12.3MB + 번들 810KB\n- 통신 계층 코드량: 기능 3개 기준 웹뷰 67줄 vs RN 54줄.\n  그중 웹뷰의 28줄은 기능이 0개여도 필요한 배관\n- SSR, 검색 노출, 공유 링크 절 추가. RN 화면에 URL 이 없어서 생기는 결과와\n  커머스에서 화면을 두 벌 만들게 되는 문제\n- 기능이 늘어날 때의 비용 성격 비교. 프로토콜이 제품이 되는 지점\n- 화면별 판단표와 RN 장단점\n\n측정 하네스도 같이 넣었습니다. logcat 계측으로 조건당 10회 반복하고 중앙값을 냅니다.\n프리워밍 조건은 고정 지연 대신 런타임 준비를 확인하고 누릅니다.\n처음에 4초 고정으로 했더니 10회 중 3회가 cold 로 잘못 기록됐습니다.\n\n빌드 과정에서 걸린 것도 주석으로 남겼습니다.\nJS 루트가 rn/ 아래라 settings.gradle 경로를 고쳐야 했고,\nRN CLI 가 android/ 를 못 찾아 react-native.config.js 로 위치를 알려 줬습니다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a985e6960e5bb4c0f29b05059c317996a3224454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/a985e6960e5bb4c0f29b05059c317996a3224454"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/699a63ea5999c0105a116260114ea9922f0938c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/699a63ea5999c0105a116260114ea9922f0938c7","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDY5OWE2M2VhNTk5OWMwMTA1YTExNjI2MDExNGVhOTkyMmYwOTM4Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/933d387fa0eb20b423945f1a21b266c3a3669b60","sha":"933d387fa0eb20b423945f1a21b266c3a3669b60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/933d387fa0eb20b423945f1a21b266c3a3669b60"}],"sha":"699a63ea5999c0105a116260114ea9922f0938c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/699a63ea5999c0105a116260114ea9922f0938c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/933d387fa0eb20b423945f1a21b266c3a3669b60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T07:57:02Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T07:57:02Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"📝 docs(02-rn-as-sdk): 장단점과 판단 기준 추가\n\n무엇이 좋아지는지는 표로 있었지만 무엇을 잃는지와 언제 쓰지 말아야 하는지가\n빠져 있었습니다. 판단에 쓰려면 그쪽이 더 중요합니다.\n\n- 얻는 것: 앱 팀의 RN 도구 불필요, 버전 업그레이드 흡수, 앱 코드에 RN 타입 0회,\n  빠뜨리면 터지는 생명주기 코드를 앱 팀에 안 줌, 여러 앱에 같은 화면 배포\n- 잃는 것: autolinking 상실, 개발 루프 지연(AAR 34초, XCFramework 는 두 아카이브),\n  디버깅 경로 길어짐(심볼과 소스맵 배포 필요), 버전 스큐, 권한 자동 증가,\n  iOS 산출물 2개, 앱 크기는 안 줄어듦\n- 언제 맞고 언제 아닌지. 한 팀이 다 만들거나 JS 를 매일 고치면 손해라는 점 명시\n- 01 번과 02 번은 택일이 아니라 순서라는 점 추가\n\n문서 상단에 검증 수준이 두 플랫폼에서 다르다는 것을 먼저 밝혔습니다.\nAndroid 는 전 기능을 눌러 봤고 iOS 는 브리지 생성과 번들 로드까지입니다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"476a3c208748ec2dba2ada3bcc492d207b2d780c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/476a3c208748ec2dba2ada3bcc492d207b2d780c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/933d387fa0eb20b423945f1a21b266c3a3669b60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","followi