ers/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/09af0448a6be3ef611c5fea1211811a41a2b2444","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDA5YWYwNDQ4YTZiZTNlZjYxMWM1ZmVhMTIxMTgxMWE0MWEyYjI0NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/5a7690aadfadbef7c4d6a0dd013a04161f6e7272","sha":"5a7690aadfadbef7c4d6a0dd013a04161f6e7272","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/5a7690aadfadbef7c4d6a0dd013a04161f6e7272"}],"sha":"09af0448a6be3ef611c5fea1211811a41a2b2444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/09af0448a6be3ef611c5fea1211811a41a2b2444"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/5a7690aadfadbef7c4d6a0dd013a04161f6e7272/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:50:28Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:50:28Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(02-rn-as-sdk): iOS 를 XCFramework 두 개로 빼고 소비 앱에서 검증\n\nAndroid 는 AAR 하나였는데 iOS 는 산출물이 둘입니다.\nhermes 가 이미 동적 프레임워크로 배포돼서 정적 병합(libtool)으로 흡수할 수 없습니다.\n\n  RnSdkKit.xcframework  25MB  우리 Swift 코드 + React pod 40여 개를 정적 흡수한 동적 프레임워크\n  hermes.xcframework    35MB  RN 이 미리 빌드해 배포하는 동적 프레임워크\n\n소비 앱 입장에서는 여전히 pod 한 줄이고 node_modules 가 없습니다.\npod install 이 의존성 1개로 끝나고, 앱 소스에 React 도 RCT 도 등장하지 않습니다.\n\n만드는 과정에서 여섯 번 막혔고 전부 다른 단계에서 터졌습니다.\n\n- 프레임워크 타깃은 브리징 헤더 불가. use_frameworks! :linkage => :static 으로\n  React pod 을 모듈화하고 import React 사용\n- use_native_modules! 가 RN CLI 로 android/app 을 찾다 실패.\n  SDK 는 android/rnsdk 라이브러리라 파싱 불가. 경로 직접 지정으로 우회\n- 빌드 스크립트가 ios/build 를 청소했는데 거기가 codegen 산출물 자리.\n  .xcbuild 로 분리\n- BUILD_LIBRARY_FOR_DISTRIBUTION 이 만드는 .swiftinterface 로 import React 가\n  새어 나가 소비 앱에서 no such module. @_implementationOnly import 로 차단\n- 모듈 이름과 클래스 이름이 둘 다 RnSdk 라 RnSdk.RnSdk.Config 로 풀리며 깨짐.\n  모듈을 RnSdkKit 으로 분리\n- GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE 누락. xcframework 도 만들어지고 앱 빌드도 되는데\n  설치 단계에서 거부\n- Resources 빌드 페이즈 누락. Android 는 assets 를 AAR 이 자동으로 담지만\n  iOS 는 명시해야 함. 런타임에 main.jsbundle 못 찾고 죽음\n\n시뮬레이터 검증: 두 프레임워크 embed 확인, 브리지 생성 성공,\nJS 번들을 프레임워크 리소스에서 로드 (RN 인스턴스: 살아 있음)\n\n.xcode.env.local 은 머신별 node 절대 경로가 들어가서 gitignore 했습니다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9d1ca3f9383e5cc69c16c9e9c2e4cdd005f389c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/b9d1ca3f9383e5cc69c16c9e9c2e4cdd005f389c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/5a7690aadfadbef7c4d6a0dd013a04161f6e7272","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/5a7690aadfadbef7c4d6a0dd013a04161f6e7272","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDVhNzY5MGFhZGZhZGJlZjdjNGQ2YTBkZDAxM2EwNDE2MWY2ZTcyNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/bb4b0ba91c10d19ab51f38f764b75bc50aea09f6","sha":"bb4b0ba91c10d19ab51f38f764b75bc50aea09f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/bb4b0ba91c10d19ab51f38f764b75bc50aea09f6"}],"sha":"5a7690aadfadbef7c4d6a0dd013a04161f6e7272","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/5a7690aadfadbef7c4d6a0dd013a04161f6e7272"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/bb4b0ba91c10d19ab51f38f764b75bc50aea09f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:02:48Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:02:48Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(02-rn-as-sdk): RN 을 AAR 로 빼고 소비 앱에서 가져다 쓰기\n\n01 번은 RN 과 네이티브 앱이 한 저장소에 있었습니다. 여기서는 RN 을 배포 가능한\nAAR 로 빼고, 그걸 의존성 한 줄로 쓰는 앱을 따로 뒀습니다.\n\n성립 전제는 com.facebook.react:react-android 가 Maven Central 에 있다는 점입니다.\n소비 앱이 node_modules 없이 Gradle 만으로 RN 을 받습니다.\n\n- rn-sdk: android library 모듈 + maven-publish. JS 번들을 assets 로 내장\n- consumer-android: 순수 Kotlin 앱. 소스 12개, node_modules 없음,\n  코드에 com.facebook.react 0회 등장\n- RnSdk 공개 API 가 ReactNativeHost, ReactRootView, moduleName, Bundle 을 전부 감춤\n- 소비 앱이 ReactApplication 을 구현하지 않으므로\n  ReactActivityDelegate.getReactNativeHost() 를 오버라이드해 SDK 의 host 를 돌려줌\n- 부분 삽입 뷰가 부모 LifecycleOwner 를 찾아 생명주기를 스스로 연결.\n  01 번에서 앱이 손으로 걸던 onHostResume 등 4개가 사라짐\n- autolinking 이 없어 MainReactPackage 를 직접 등록\n- 번들 자동화가 없어 Gradle 이 파일 존재를 검사하고 없으면 빌드를 세움\n- consumer-rules.pro 로 난독화 규칙을 AAR 에 담아 소비 앱에 자동 병합\n\n에뮬레이터 검증: 콜드 스타트 380ms, SDK 첫 렌더 246ms, 인스턴스 공유,\nPromise 왕복, 결과 리스너, 테마 이벤트, releaseMemory 후 재생성 313ms\n\n매니페스트 병합에서 확인한 것: 소비 앱이 권한을 하나도 안 적었는데\nINTERNET 과 SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW 가 붙습니다. 후자는 react-android debug 변종의\n개발자 메뉴 오버레이용입니다. SDK 가 소비 앱 권한을 늘린다는 점을 README 에 명시\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdb39338943a8c3520853934c215c28404d2506d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/cdb39338943a8c3520853934c215c28404d2506d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/bb4b0ba91c10d19ab51f38f764b75bc50aea09f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/bb4b0ba91c10d19ab51f38f764b75bc50aea09f6","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGJiNGIwYmE5MWMxMGQxOWFiNTFmMzhmNzY0Yjc1YmM1MGFlYTA5ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/f636996f841711bba54e5bc6aff524972d19c629","sha":"f636996f841711bba54e5bc6aff524972d19c629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/f636996f841711bba54e5bc6aff524972d19c629"}],"sha":"bb4b0ba91c10d19ab51f38f764b75bc50aea09f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/bb4b0ba91c10d19ab51f38f764b75bc50aea09f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/f636996f841711bba54e5bc6aff524972d19c629/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T05:25:42Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T05:25:42Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"📝 docs(brownfield): 번들과 네이티브가 무엇을 나눠 갖는지 추가\n\nAPK 에 libreactnative.so 와 JS 번들이 같이 있는 게 중복으로 보이는데\n같은 기능의 서로 다른 절반이라는 점을 Text 하나로 추적해서 설명합니다.\n\n- Text.js 의 uiViewClassName ''RCTText'' 와 ReactTextViewManager.REACT_CLASS 가\n  만나는 지점. JS 에는 위젯 생성 코드가 없고 네이티브에는 props 기본값이 없음\n- 번들 구성 실측. 489개 모듈 중 react-native JS 가 86.2%, 앱 코드는 0.4%\n- 서드파티도 같은 구조. reanimated 는 npm 한 번 설치고 Common/cpp 를\n  android 와 apple 이 공유. 플랫폼별 코드는 얇은 층\n- reanimated 는 예외. UI 스레드에 두 번째 Hermes 런타임을 띄워\n  프레임마다 브리지를 왕복하지 않음. 여기서는 런타임 복사본이 하나 더 생김\n- 번들을 기능별로 쪼갤 때 프레임워크 JS 가 배수로 중복되는 문제와\n  base/feature 분리. serializer.createModuleIdFactory 와 processModuleFilter\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1bd05289a53af62654ad6126655634309b2d256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/f1bd05289a53af62654ad6126655634309b2d256"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/f636996f841711bba54e5bc6aff524972d19c629","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/f636996f841711bba54e5bc6aff524972d19c629","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGY2MzY5OTZmODQxNzExYmJhNTRlNWJjNmFmZjUyNDk3MmQxOWM2Mjk","parents"