es.gradle.org 공식 값)\n- 고정 후 ./gradlew --version 으로 동작 확인\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c43a94ee8b1857f4cd6526f6c9ace23762974f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/0c43a94ee8b1857f4cd6526f6c9ace23762974f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/e61ae7d1c1411c732c1f6996970e267278e34921","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/e61ae7d1c1411c732c1f6996970e267278e34921","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGU2MWFlN2QxYzE0MTFjNzMyYzFmNjk5Njk3MGUyNjcyNzhlMzQ5MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/cc02b2690c62feb10053a9d511b1794fd30c084d","sha":"cc02b2690c62feb10053a9d511b1794fd30c084d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/cc02b2690c62feb10053a9d511b1794fd30c084d"}],"sha":"e61ae7d1c1411c732c1f6996970e267278e34921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/e61ae7d1c1411c732c1f6996970e267278e34921"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/cc02b2690c62feb10053a9d511b1794fd30c084d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T05:15:14Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T05:15:53Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"📝 docs: 측정 범위를 표시 대신 문장으로 서술\n\n대괄호 태그를 붙이는 대신 무엇을 어떤 조건에서 쟀는지 문장으로 밝히도록 바꿨습니다.\n읽는 사람에게 전달되는 정보는 같고 문서가 덜 걸리적거립니다.\n\n- 루트 README 기록 규칙을 \"조건을 문장으로 밝힌다\"로 대체\n- \"아직 안 잰 것\" 절을 \"측정 범위 밖\"으로 바꾸고 인용 시 주의점으로 서술\n- 에뮬레이터 한계, 3회 측정의 편차, 진입 시간의 정의를 각각 문장으로 명시\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a610c0ae5ba7b41828a4a8dfea300538f7b6a7de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/a610c0ae5ba7b41828a4a8dfea300538f7b6a7de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/cc02b2690c62feb10053a9d511b1794fd30c084d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/cc02b2690c62feb10053a9d511b1794fd30c084d","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGNjMDJiMjY5MGM2MmZlYjEwMDUzYTlkNTExYjE3OTRmZDMwYzA4NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/932bb4c79fdb8d375b437f584f120ae268443801","sha":"932bb4c79fdb8d375b437f584f120ae268443801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/932bb4c79fdb8d375b437f584f120ae268443801"}],"sha":"cc02b2690c62feb10053a9d511b1794fd30c084d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/cc02b2690c62feb10053a9d511b1794fd30c084d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/932bb4c79fdb8d375b437f584f120ae268443801/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T05:12:06Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T05:12:06Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"📝 docs(brownfield): 동작 원리 정리 문서 추가\n\nJS 가 네이티브 앱에 어떻게 붙는지를 예제 코드와 실측치로 설명합니다.\n개념마다 저장소에서 직접 확인하는 방법을 붙였습니다.\n\n- 바이트코드와 네이티브 바이너리 구분. APK 한 장에 DEX, HBC, .so 가 같이 들어 있음\n- Hermes 는 hermesc(빌드 타임 컴파일러)와 libhermes.so(런타임 엔진) 두 개\n- APK 디컴파일 3단계와 HBC 가 jadx 로 안 열린다는 점\n- 두 플랫폼이 AppRegistry.runApplication 하나로 수렴하는 지점\n- 브리지가 주고받는 것. __fbBatchedBridgeConfig 와 MessageQueue.spy\n- 인스턴스 수명. 번들 hot-swap 은 없고 새 번들 로드는 곧 컨텍스트 재생성\n- RN 0.76 에서 onCatalystInstanceDestroy 는 forRemoval. invalidate() 를 써야 함\n- OTA 와 스토어 정책. 왜 DEX 는 되고 .so 는 안 되는지, 브라운필드의 버전 스큐 문제\n- 소유권 경계 4개 중 네비게이션만 답을 안 정했음을 명시\n\n커밋 전 저장소 전체 스캔했습니다. 서명 파일, 자격증명, 개인정보 없습니다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ef98389aa3132cbb5aeb8bc5de716dc8ab40157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/9ef98389aa3132cbb5aeb8bc5de716dc8ab40157"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/932bb4c79fdb8d375b437f584f120ae268443801","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/932bb4c79fdb8d375b437f584f120ae268443801","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDkzMmJiNGM3OWZkYjhkMzc1YjQzN2Y1ODRmMTIwYWUyNjg0NDM4MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/9f77106aa0fb1cfec4a8f0e576c2b595ab336dbc","sha":"9f77106aa0fb1cfec4a8f0e576c2b595ab336dbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/9f77106aa0fb1cfec4a8f0e576c2b595ab336dbc"}],"sha":"932bb4c79fdb8d375b437f584f120ae268443801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/932bb4c79fdb8d375b437f584f120ae268443801"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/9f77106aa0fb1cfec4a8f0e576c2b595ab336dbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T05:02:51Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T05:02:51Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"🐛 fix(brownfield): hermesEnabled=false 로 빌드하면 JS 엔진이 안 들어가던 문제\n\napp/build.gradle 에 if (hermesEnabled) 만 있고 else 가 없었습니다.\n끄면 어떤 JS 엔진도 안 실려서 빌드는 통과하고 실행할 때 죽습니다.\nREADME 에는 켜고 끄며 비교하는 스위치라고 적어 뒀는데 실제로는 끌 수 없었습니다.\n\n- else 에 org.webkit:android-jsc:r250231 추가. 실제로 빌드하고 에뮬레이터에서 동작 확인\n- gradle.properties 주석을 \"엔진을 쓸지 말지\"가 아니라 \"어느 엔진을 쓸지\"로 고침\n- README 에 hermesc(빌드 타임 컴파일러)와 libhermes.so(런타임 엔진) 구분 추가\n- Hermes/JSC 실측 비교. APK 18.4 vs 21.7MB, 엔진 so 2.27 vs 5.82MB,\n  번들 814KB(바이트코드) vs 915KB(텍스트)\n- 시작 시간은 이 에뮬레이터에서 차이가 안 났음. 3회 측정이라 편차 안에 묻혔고\n  저사양 실기기에서 다시 재야 함\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c583587bff3318eba45b917fe286156e13a0f8dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/c583587bff3318eba45b917fe286156e13a0f8dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/9f77106aa0fb1cfec4a8f0e576c2b595ab336dbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/9f77106aa0fb1cfec4a8f0e576c2b595ab336dbc","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDlmNzcxMDZhYTBmYjFjZmVjNGE4ZjBlNTc2YzJiNTk1YWIzMzZkYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/c4c57caaf3407fa07dbe8facdba98bd986d3bee6","sha":"c4c57caaf3407fa07dbe8facdba98bd986d3bee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/c4c57caaf3407fa07dbe8facdba98bd986d3bee6"}],"sha":"9f77106aa0fb1cfec4a8f0e576c2b595ab336dbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/9f77106aa0fb1cfec4a8f0e576c2b595ab336dbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/c4c57caaf3407fa07dbe8facdba98bd986d3bee6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:40:58Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:40:58Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"📝 docs(brownfield): 실행 검증 결과와 시작/진입 시간 실측 추가\n\n에뮬레이터(Pixel 9)와 시뮬레이터(iPhone 15)에서 전 경로를 눌러 본 결과입니다.\n\n- 콜드 스타트와 RN 진입 시간 측정. release/preload=false 기준\n  콜드 스타트 175~390ms, 첫 진입 188ms, 재진입 55ms\n- 디버그 값은 Metro 오버헤드가 섞여 있어 그대로 쓸 수 없다는 점 명시\n- preload 를 켜도 콜드 스타트가 안 늘어난 이유(백그라운드 생성 + am start -W 의\n  측정 범위)를 적음. 비용이 사라진 게 아니라 이 방법에 안 잡히는 것\n- \"돌려 보고 나서야 나온 것들\" 절 추가. 빌드 통과와 화면이 뜨는 것은 별개였음\n- 테마 이벤트 버튼 위치 변경 반영\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc3e506b10d882a501bb2b0dca5171e11021580b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/cc3e506b10d882a501bb2b0dca5171e11021580b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/c4c57caaf3407fa07dbe8facdba98bd986d3bee6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/c4c57caaf3407fa07dbe8facdba98bd986d3bee6","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGM0YzU3Y2FhZjM0MDdmYTA3ZGJlOGZhY2RiYTk4YmQ5ODZkM2JlZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/01a021213cdc8496b7f465d0a32d07f2953048bd","sha":"01a021213cdc8496b7f465d0a32d07f2953048bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/01a021213cdc8496b7f465d0a32d07f2953048bd"}],"sha":"c4c57caaf3407fa07dbe8facdba98bd986d3bee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/c4c57caaf3407fa07dbe8facdba98bd986d3bee6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/01a021213cdc8496b7f465d0a32d07f2953048bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:39:33Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:39:33Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"🐛 fix(brownfield): 에뮬레이터/시뮬레이터에서 드러난 문제 수정\n\n실제로 띄워 보고 나서야 보인 것들입니다.\n\n- RnHostActivity 진입 시 NPE 로 죽던 문제\n  ReactActivity 생성자가 필드 초기화로 createReactActivityDelegate() 를 부르는데\n  그 시점에는 intent 가 null 입니다. moduleName 과 initialProps 를 읽는 코드를\n  delegate 의 getMainComponentName() / getLaunchOptions() 안으로 옮겼습니다\n- iOS RN 화면이 상태바와 네비게이션 바를 침범하던 문제\n  RCTRootView 를 view 에 대입하지 않고 safe area 에 제약으로 붙였습니다.\n  네이티브가 safe area 를 책임지고 RN 은 그 안쪽만 그립니다\n- \"네이티브 호출 → 첫 렌더\" 가 리렌더마다 다시 계산되던 문제\n  useState 초기화 함수로 옮겨 첫 렌더 시점 값으로 고정했습니다\n- 테마 이벤트 데모가 확인 불가능하던 문제\n  버튼이 네이티브 첫 화면에만 있어서, 누를 때는 RN 화면이 떠 있지 않아\n  리스너가 없었습니다. 부분 삽입 화면의 네이티브 바로 버튼을 옮겨\n  네이티브와 RN 이 한 화면에 있을 때 도착하는 걸 보게 했습니다.\n  첫 화면 버튼은 \"받는 쪽이 없다\"를 보여주는 용도로 남깁니다\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de4d331f5bb5b39d9c63a3a924c2340d464bde69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/de4d331f5bb5b39d9c63a3a924c2340d464bde69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/01a021213cdc8496b7f465d0a32d07f2953048bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/01a021213cdc8496b7f465d0a32d07f2953048bd","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDAxYTAyMTIxM2NkYzg0OTZiN2Y0NjVkMGEzMmQwN2YyOTUzMDQ4YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/379f17353aa63cc4851b505573e2cc86cb547375","sha":"379f17353aa63cc4851b505573e2cc86cb547375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/379f17353aa63cc4851b505573e2cc86cb547375"}],"sha":"01a021213cdc8496b7f465d0a32d07f2953048bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/01a021213cdc8496b7f465d0a32d07f2953048bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/379f17353aa63cc4851b505573e2cc86cb547375/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:19:14Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:19:14Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"📝 docs: 루트 README 에 브라운필드 실험 연결\n\n- experiments/01-brownfield 링크와 진행 상태 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7855349b55b44e5ba1606c406d9af9a20f166d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/c7855349b55b44e5ba1606c406d9af9a20f166d6"},"url":"https: