evchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/ad6673d7112e015d5b8d283a2d7fa09750b84d0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:18:41Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:18:41Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"📝 docs(brownfield): README 와 크기 실측치 추가\n\n- 두 플랫폼의 진입점 구조를 표로 비교. iOS 에 ReactNativeHost 대응물이 없는 이유 포함\n- APK 크기 실측: debug 4ABI 111.5MB, release 4ABI 50.7MB,\n  arm64만 18.4MB, arm64+R8 14.4MB\n- arm64 릴리스 내부 구성 분해. R8 로 줄어드는 4MB 는 거의 dex 쪽\n- reactNativeArchitectures 와 abiFilters 를 헷갈리지 않게 양쪽에 주석 추가.\n  전자는 소스 빌드용이라 prebuilt 를 쓰는 0.76 에서는 APK 크기가 안 줄어듦\n- 측정 knob 을 gradle 속성으로 노출 (-PabiFilters, -Pminify)\n- 측정 범위 밖인 항목을 문장으로 명시\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f06637f13efbbabbe9c4ff53a8e458817dd29ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/f06637f13efbbabbe9c4ff53a8e458817dd29ec9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/ad6673d7112e015d5b8d283a2d7fa09750b84d0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/ad6673d7112e015d5b8d283a2d7fa09750b84d0b","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGFkNjY3M2Q3MTEyZTAxNWQ1YjhkMjgzYTJkN2ZhMDk3NTBiODRkMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/ca9b06e55099a1b3e77d2fc8fa1bb7a698ab903a","sha":"ca9b06e55099a1b3e77d2fc8fa1bb7a698ab903a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/ca9b06e55099a1b3e77d2fc8fa1bb7a698ab903a"}],"sha":"ad6673d7112e015d5b8d283a2d7fa09750b84d0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/ad6673d7112e015d5b8d283a2d7fa09750b84d0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/ca9b06e55099a1b3e77d2fc8fa1bb7a698ab903a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:13:23Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:13:23Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(brownfield): iOS 네이티브 호스트 앱 추가\n\nSwift 네이티브 앱에 같은 JS 번들을 얹는 쪽. 시뮬레이터 디버그 빌드 통과 확인했습니다.\n\n- ReactNativeManager 가 RCTBridge 를 하나 들고 있음. iOS 에는 ReactNativeHost 에 해당하는\n  기성 클래스가 없어서 브리지 보관 객체를 따로 두는 구조\n- RnHostViewController(전체 화면)와 EmbeddedRnViewController(부분 삽입) 두 진입점\n- HostBridge 를 Swift 로 쓰고 RCT_EXTERN_MODULE 용 .m 을 함께 둠. 안드로이드와 모듈명 동일\n- 네이티브 → RN 이벤트는 NotificationCenter 를 거쳐 RCTEventEmitter 로 전달\n- 브리징 헤더로 RN 헤더를 명시적으로 노출. import React 는 pod 구성에 따라 실패함\n- .xcodeproj 는 scripts/generate_xcodeproj.rb 로 생성. 설정을 코드로 읽을 수 있게 하고\n  pbxproj 수동 편집을 피하려는 목적\n- 서명 정보와 팀 ID 는 넣지 않음. 시뮬레이터는 서명 없이 빌드되게 설정\n- ATS 는 NSAllowsArbitraryLoads 대신 NSAllowsLocalNetworking 만 허용\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76ace40e81ae9b05ccbc76f8c833d2b895773d5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/76ace40e81ae9b05ccbc76f8c833d2b895773d5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/ca9b06e55099a1b3e77d2fc8fa1bb7a698ab903a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/ca9b06e55099a1b3e77d2fc8fa1bb7a698ab903a","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGNhOWIwNmU1NTA5OWExYjNlNzdkMmZjOGZhMWJiN2E2OThhYjkwM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/1f7b41cbcef5e30858f4343ece0018a00a924199","sha":"1f7b41cbcef5e30858f4343ece0018a00a924199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/1f7b41cbcef5e30858f4343ece0018a00a924199"}],"sha":"ca9b06e55099a1b3e77d2fc8fa1bb7a698ab903a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/ca9b06e55099a1b3e77d2fc8fa1bb7a698ab903a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/1f7b41cbcef5e30858f4343ece0018a00a924199/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:08:33Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:08:33Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(brownfield): 안드로이드 네이티브 호스트 앱 추가\n\nKotlin 네이티브 앱에 RN 화면을 얹는 쪽. assembleDebug 통과 확인했습니다.\n\n- HostApplication 이 ReactNativeHost 를 하나만 들고 모든 RN 화면이 공유\n- 진입점 두 가지를 나란히 둠\n  - RnHostActivity(ReactActivity 상속): 전체 화면, moduleName 과 initialProps 를 Intent 로 받음\n  - EmbeddedRnActivity(ReactRootView 직접): 네이티브 레이아웃 안에 부분 삽입, 생명주기 수동 연결\n- HostBridgeModule 로 닫기, 결과 반환, 호스트 정보 조회(Promise), 테마 이벤트 발신\n- PRELOAD_REACT_INSTANCE 스위치로 인스턴스 생성 시점(앱 시작 vs 첫 진입) 비교 가능\n- 기본값과 같은 값이라도 react {} 블록 경로를 전부 명시. 기존 앱에 옮겨 붙일 때 체크리스트가 됨\n- 평문 통신 허용은 src/debug 매니페스트에만 두고, 서명 설정과 키스토어는 넣지 않음\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32ba10a886a65fa4c43718c41b1a1d945aba3655","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/32ba10a886a65fa4c43718c41b1a1d945aba3655"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/1f7b41cbcef5e30858f4343ece0018a00a924199","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/1f7b41cbcef5e30858f4343ece0018a00a924199","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKDFmN2I0MWNiY2VmNWUzMDg1OGY0MzQzZWNlMDAxOGEwMGE5MjQxOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/b7320585ca47525f57cd6577385128588041999d","sha":"b7320585ca47525f57cd6577385128588041999d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/b7320585ca47525f57cd6577385128588041999d"}],"sha":"1f7b41cbcef5e30858f4343ece0018a00a924199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/1f7b41cbcef5e30858f4343ece0018a00a924199"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/b7320585ca47525f57cd6577385128588041999d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:02:35Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T01:02:35Z","email":"bokchidevchan@gmail.com","name":"chanchanchan"},"message":"✨ feat(brownfield): RN 화면 번들 추가\n\n브라운필드 통합 예제의 JS 쪽. 네이티브 호스트가 골라 띄울 진입점을 준비합니다.\n\n- AppRegistry 에 화면 2개(RNProductDetail, RNSettings) 등록. 네이티브가 moduleName 으로 고릅니다\n- HostBridge 래퍼로 네이티브 호출을 한 파일에 모음 (닫기, 결과 반환, 호스트 정보 조회, 테마 이벤트)\n- instanceCounter 로 화면 간 JS 컨텍스트 공유 여부를 화면에서 눈으로 확인\n- initialProps 의 launchedAtMs 로 네이티브 호출부터 첫 렌더까지 측정\n- RN 0.76.9, Old Architecture (newArchEnabled=false)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0adcefab7e9079f8d1cccbce996ce9d7822ec57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/trees/c0adcefab7e9079f8d1cccbce996ce9d7822ec57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/git/commits/b7320585ca47525f57cd6577385128588041999d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226874517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan","id":226874517,"login":"bokchidevchan","node_id":"U_kgDODYXUlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bokchidevchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/b7320585ca47525f57cd6577385128588041999d","node_id":"C_kwDOTxy5AdoAKGI3MzIwNTg1Y2E0NzUyNWY1N2NkNjU3NzM4NTEyODU4ODA0MTk5OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commit/ca8d7b346be9a9e3a798ee739696bf4932d493ab","sha":"ca8d7b346be9a9e3a798ee739696bf4932d493ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/ca8d7b346be9a9e3a798ee739696bf4932d493ab"}],"sha":"b7320585ca47525f57cd6577385128588041999d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokchidevchan/rn-brownfield-lab/commits/b7320585ca47525f57cd6577385128588041999d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith