b.com/repos/SergioAscurraPerez/Equipo3-UrbanPulse/commits/69ab77571361f391f3e8bb14dfebe4a223e91e2f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147674356?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SergioAscurraPerez","id":147674356,"login":"SergioAscurraPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCM1U9A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioAscurraPerez/Equipo3-UrbanPulse/commits/430479a07e98dbf152d44f9ca90d6f633fa5d690/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T23:37:34Z","email":"sergioascurra.27102005@gmail.com","name":"Seeebaastian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T23:37:34Z","email":"sergioascurra.27102005@gmail.com","name":"Seeebaastian"},"message":"fix(mapa): habilitar cssCodeSplit para que el remote federado cargue sus estilos\n\nEl mismo merge de la rama Linares (PR #226) que rompio la TomTom API key\ntambien puso cssCodeSplit: false en mf-mapa-urbano/vite.config.js. Con eso,\nVite empaqueta todo el CSS del microfrontend en un unico archivo que solo se\nenlaza en su index.html standalone, y el chunk dinamico \"./MapaUrbano\" que\nconsume el shell via Module Federation no queda asociado a ningun CSS.\n\nResultado en produccion: el mapa de TomTom se inicializa (ya con el fix de\nla key) pero sin ningun estilo de Tailwind, por lo que el buscador, el\ncontrol de capas, la leyenda y el boton de ayuda quedan invisibles/sin\nmaquetar, aunque en local (donde el dev server de Vite inyecta el CSS de\notra forma) se ve completo.\n\nVerificado localmente: con cssCodeSplit en su valor por defecto, el CSS del\ncomponente aparece como dependencia del chunk dinamico (MapaUrbano-*.css en\n__vite__mapDeps), por lo que el helper de precarga de Vite lo inyecta como\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\"> al cargar el remote, igual que sus demas JS chunks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f6267ba597c055ad484dc54d72e01d0b2cdd1fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioAscurraPerez/Equipo3-UrbanPulse/git/trees/9f6267ba597c055ad484dc54d72e01d0b2cdd1fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioAscurraPerez/Equipo3-UrbanPulse/git/commits/430479a07e98dbf152d44f9ca90d6f633fa5d690","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147674356?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SergioAscurraPerez","id":147674356,"login":"SergioAscurraPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCM1U9A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioAscurraPerez/starred{/owner